        "Dream Dollars": "Dream Dollars",
        "Dream Dollars (D$) are symbolic simulation tokens that cannot be purchased, gambled, or withdrawn. They act as a behavioral mirror for where your daily energy is invested.": "Los Dream Dollars (D$) son fichas simb\xF3licas de simulaci\xF3n que no se pueden comprar, apostar ni retirar. Reflejan en qu\xE9 inviertes tu energ\xEDa diaria.",
