        'I just unlocked "{name}" in my simulation through daily completed missions on One Decision Away.': 'Acabo de desbloquear "{name}" en mi simulaci\xF3n al completar misiones diarias en One Decision Away.',
        "I refuse to become someone who leaves their best ideas in notes and lets distraction decide their life.": "Me niego a convertirme en alguien que deja sus mejores ideas en notas y permite que la distracci\xF3n decida su vida.",
        "I refuse to become someone who leaves their best potential in draft notes and lets distraction decide their fate.": "Me niego a convertirme en alguien que deja su mejor potencial en borradores y permite que la distracci\xF3n decida su destino.",
