        "Identify the one compromise you made yesterday that your Future Self would never accept. Refuse to repeat it today.": "Identifica la concesi\xF3n que hiciste ayer y que tu Yo Futuro nunca aceptar\xEDa. Ni\xE9gate a repetirla hoy.",
        "Identify the one task you have delayed 3 times this week. Execute its next concrete step before opening your inbox.": "Identifica la tarea que has pospuesto 3 veces esta semana. Da su siguiente paso concreto antes de abrir el correo.",
