        "If Nothing Changes \u2014 Timeline": "Si nada cambia \u2014 Cronolog\xEDa",
        "If a thought appears, let it drift past like a cloud, and return to the feeling of the breath.": "Si aparece un pensamiento, deja que pase como una nube y vuelve a sentir la respiraci\xF3n.",
        "If distractions come, you will write them down and return. You do not chase them.": "Si aparecen distracciones, las anotar\xE1s y volver\xE1s. No ir\xE1s tras ellas.",
        "If nothing changes, describe an ordinary Tuesday five years from now \u2014 wake-up to lights-out.": "Si nada cambia, describe un martes normal dentro de cinco a\xF1os \u2014 desde que despiertas hasta que apagas la luz.",
        "If nothing changes, describe an ordinary Tuesday five years from now.": "Si nada cambia, describe un martes normal dentro de cinco a\xF1os.",
        "If something went wrong, let it be. Tomorrow is a new chance. Tonight, you rest.": "Si algo sali\xF3 mal, d\xE9jalo estar. Ma\xF1ana tendr\xE1s otra oportunidad. Esta noche descansas.",
        "If the One Decision isn't done, this is the hour. 25 minutes, phone away.": "Si a\xFAn no has completado tu Una Decisi\xF3n, este es el momento. 25 minutos, m\xF3vil apartado.",
        "If you want to go fast, go alone. If you want to go far, go together with clear vision and uncompromising standards.": "Si quieres ir r\xE1pido, ve solo. Si quieres llegar lejos, ve acompa\xF1ado con una visi\xF3n clara y est\xE1ndares firmes.",
