        "Weekly retrospective": "Retrospectiva semanal",
        "Weightless open-air speed and relentless pursuit of performance efficiency.": "Velocidad ligera a cielo abierto y b\xFAsqueda incansable de la eficiencia de rendimiento.",
        "Weissach Motorsport Engineered": "Ingenier\xEDa de Weissach Motorsport",
        "Weissach Package": "Paquete Weissach",
        "Welcome grant for beginning your journey": "Bonificaci\xF3n de bienvenida por empezar tu camino",
        "Welcome. Find a comfortable position, and let your eyes gently close.": "Bienvenido. Busca una postura c\xF3moda y deja que tus ojos se cierren suavemente.",
        "Welcome. Take a slow breath, and let the day soften.": "Bienvenido. Respira despacio y deja que el d\xEDa se suavice.",
        "Wellbeing & Joy": "Bienestar y alegr\xEDa",
        "Wellness Retreat Weekend": "Fin de semana de retiro de bienestar",
        "What Avoidance Protects:": "Lo que protege la evitaci\xF3n:",
        "What Money Lets You Say No To:": "A qu\xE9 te permite decir no el dinero:",
        "What action did you take today? How did you overcome friction? What does this mean for your future life?": "\xBFQu\xE9 acci\xF3n has realizado hoy? \xBFC\xF3mo has superado los obst\xE1culos? \xBFQu\xE9 significa esto para tu vida futura?",
        "What are you known for, and by whom?": "\xBFPor qu\xE9 te conocen y qui\xE9nes te conocen por ello?",
        "What decision, vision moment, or realization happened?": "\xBFQu\xE9 decisi\xF3n, momento de visi\xF3n o descubrimiento ha ocurrido?",
        "What dissatisfaction have you quietly agreed to live with?": "\xBFCon qu\xE9 insatisfacci\xF3n has aceptado vivir en silencio?",
        "What do you complain about but never actually take action to change?": "\xBFDe qu\xE9 te quejas sin hacer nunca nada para cambiarlo?",
        'What does financial autonomy let you say "no" to?': '\xBFA qu\xE9 te permite decir "no" la autonom\xEDa financiera?',
        "What fear, discomfort, or judgment are your current avoidance habits protecting you from?": "\xBFDe qu\xE9 miedo, incomodidad o juicio te protegen tus h\xE1bitos actuales de evitaci\xF3n?",
        "What fueled your focus or caused friction today? (e.g. 7 hours uninterrupted sleep, box breathing session, deep work win)...": "\xBFQu\xE9 ha favorecido tu concentraci\xF3n o creado obst\xE1culos hoy? (p. ej. 7 horas de sue\xF1o sin interrupciones, sesi\xF3n de respiraci\xF3n cuadrada, logro de trabajo profundo)...",
        "What happens if you change nothing for 5 to 10 years.": "Qu\xE9 ocurre si no cambias nada durante 5 a 10 a\xF1os.",
        "What is that protection actually costing you in time, dignity, and potential?": "\xBFCu\xE1nto te est\xE1 costando realmente esa protecci\xF3n en tiempo, dignidad y potencial?",
        "What is the first physical move that connects this dream to reality?": "\xBFCu\xE1l es el primer movimiento f\xEDsico que conecta este sue\xF1o con la realidad?",
        "What is the one decision that would make today meaningful?": "\xBFCu\xE1l es la decisi\xF3n que har\xEDa que hoy tuviera sentido?",
        "What makes today meaningful:": "Lo que da sentido a hoy:",
        "What we achieve inwardly will change outer reality.": "Lo que logramos por dentro cambiar\xE1 la realidad exterior.",
        "Whatever came, hold it. That is your instruction for today.": "Sea lo que sea que haya surgido, cons\xE9rvalo. Esa es tu indicaci\xF3n para hoy.",
        "Whatever you avoided yesterday is the One Decision for today.": "Lo que evitaste ayer es la Decisi\xF3n de hoy.",
        "When you voluntarily embrace physical effort, modern mental stress loses its power over your nervous system.": "Cuando aceptas voluntariamente el esfuerzo f\xEDsico, el estr\xE9s mental actual pierde poder sobre tu sistema nervioso.",
        "When your emotional anchor to your future life is vivid, momentary discomfort fades.": "Cuando el v\xEDnculo emocional con tu vida futura es intenso, la incomodidad moment\xE1nea se desvanece.",
        "When your inner identity is anchored in {futureRole}, the physical manifestation of {dName} is merely a matter of time and calm persistence.": "Cuando tu identidad interior se afianza en {futureRole}, la materializaci\xF3n de {dName} es solo cuesti\xF3n de tiempo y perseverancia serena.",
        "Where you place your gaze determines the emotional tone and trajectory of your day.": "Donde pones la mirada determina el tono emocional y el rumbo de tu d\xEDa.",
        "Which doors are closed for good? Who did you become to the people who depend on you? What is the one sentence you would say about the last decade?": "\xBFQu\xE9 puertas se han cerrado para siempre? \xBFEn qui\xE9n te has convertido para quienes dependen de ti? \xBFQu\xE9 frase dir\xEDas sobre la \xFAltima d\xE9cada?",
        "Which opportunities did you watch other people take? What does your body feel like? What do you tell yourself at 11pm?": "\xBFQu\xE9 oportunidades has visto aprovechar a otros? \xBFC\xF3mo se siente tu cuerpo? \xBFQu\xE9 te dices a las 23:00?",
        "Which outdated version of yourself would you need to let go of to change?": "\xBFQu\xE9 versi\xF3n anticuada de ti tendr\xEDas que dejar atr\xE1s para cambiar?",
        "White Beach Houses Behind the Dunes": "Casas blancas de playa tras las dunas",
        "White Cube Villa": "Villa de cubos blancos",
        "White desk under a big window, one monitor, one plant, one purpose.": "Escritorio blanco bajo una gran ventana, un monitor, una planta, un prop\xF3sito.",
        "White-walled, art-first apartment with oak floors, a sculptural kitchen and a north-facing light that never glares.": "Apartamento de paredes blancas centrado en el arte, con suelos de roble, cocina escult\xF3rica y luz del norte que nunca deslumbra.",
        "Whitewashed Stone": "Piedra encalada",
        "Who is around you, and how do you show up for them?": "\xBFQui\xE9n te rodea y c\xF3mo est\xE1s presente para esas personas?",
        "Why Do You Want This Dream?": "\xBFPor qu\xE9 quieres este sue\xF1o?",
        "Why Do You Want This? (Your Emotional Anchor)": "\xBFPor qu\xE9 quieres esto? (Tu ancla emocional)",
        "Why This Matters / Core Vision (Optional)": "Por qu\xE9 importa / Visi\xF3n principal (opcional)",
        "Wide Porch": "Porche amplio",
        "Wild Garden": "Jard\xEDn silvestre",
        "Window Light": "Luz de ventana",
        "Wine Cellar": "Bodega",
        "Wine Pairing": "Maridaje de vinos",
        "Wine Wall": "Pared vinoteca",
        "Winter as a season to look forward to, not survive.": "El invierno como una estaci\xF3n que esperas con ilusi\xF3n, no que intentas sobrevivir.",
        "Winter weekends without the transfer.": "Fines de semana de invierno sin el traslado.",
        "Wisdom Delivery Time": "Hora de entrega de sabidur\xEDa",
        "With the Winemaker": "Con el en\xF3logo",
        "Wk {n} ({from} - {to})": "Sem. {n} ({from} - {to})",
        "Woke up at 6:00 AM without hitting snooze. Sat in quiet stillness with black coffee before looking at any screens. Visualized walking into the morning light of the waterfront villa\u2014felt the standard of the day elevate immediately.": "Me despert\xE9 a las 6:00 sin posponer la alarma. Me sent\xE9 en silencio con un caf\xE9 solo antes de mirar cualquier pantalla. Me imagin\xE9 entrando en la luz de la ma\xF1ana de la villa frente al agua\u2014sent\xED c\xF3mo se elevaba de inmediato el nivel del d\xEDa.",
        "Woking, United Kingdom": "Woking, United Kingdom",
        "Wonder \u2014 the feeling that makes everything else feel small.": "Asombro \u2014 la sensaci\xF3n que hace que todo lo dem\xE1s parezca peque\xF1o.",
        "Wood Sauna": "Sauna de madera",
        "Wood Stove": "Estufa de le\xF1a",
        "Wooden cabin on a still lake ringed by forest, wide porch, canoe, and a screened room for summer nights.": "Caba\xF1a de madera junto a un lago tranquilo rodeado de bosque, con amplio porche, canoa y sala con mosquiteras para las noches de verano.",
        "Work & Enterprise": "Trabajo y empresa",
        "Work & Purpose": "Trabajo y prop\xF3sito",
        "Workspace": "Espacio de trabajo",
        "Workstation and hardware": "Puesto de trabajo y equipo",
        "Write high-impact product proposition and strategic roadmap": "Redacta una propuesta de producto de gran impacto y una hoja de ruta estrat\xE9gica",
        "Write it": "Escr\xEDbela",
        "Write one line in the journal: what did today teach you?": "Escribe una l\xEDnea en el diario: \xBFqu\xE9 te ha ense\xF1ado hoy?",
        "Write your honest observation here...": "Escribe aqu\xED tu observaci\xF3n sincera...",
        "Writer's Cabin in the Woods": "Caba\xF1a de escritor en el bosque",
        "Writing & Clarity": "Escritura y claridad",
        "Writing & Reflection": "Escritura y reflexi\xF3n",
        "Written from ten years down the default path. Read it when you feel the pull to postpone.": "Escrito desde diez a\xF1os despu\xE9s de seguir el camino por defecto. L\xE9elo cuando sientas la tentaci\xF3n de posponer.",
        "Yacht Afternoon": "Tarde en yate",
        "Yachts & Jets": "Yates y jets",
        "Yearly ($49 / yr \xB7 Save 42%)": "Anual ($49 / a\xF1o \xB7 Ahorra un 42%)",
        "Years of postponement and staying in a comfortable plateau.": "A\xF1os de posponer y permanecer en una meseta c\xF3moda.",
        "Yellow Gold": "Oro amarillo",
        "Yes, Delete": "S\xED, eliminar",
        "Yes, Reset Everything": "S\xED, restablecer todo",
        "Yest.": "Ayer",
        "Yoga Deck": "Terraza de yoga",
        "You already own this dream in My Future Life": "Este sue\xF1o ya es tuyo en Mi Vida Futura",
        "You are allowed to be proud of a small day.": "Puedes sentir orgullo por un d\xEDa sencillo.",
        "You are always exactly one decisive choice away from an entirely different standard of living.": "Siempre est\xE1s a una sola decisi\xF3n firme de un nivel de vida completamente distinto.",
        "You are not merely wishing for {dName}; you are cultivating the caliber of mind and standard of execution that makes it inevitable.": "No te limitas a desear {dName}; cultivas la calidad de pensamiento y el nivel de acci\xF3n que lo hacen inevitable.",
        "You are safe. You are calm. You are allowed to rest.": "Est\xE1s a salvo. Est\xE1s en calma. Puedes descansar.",
        "You are safe. You are warm. You are done for today.": "Est\xE1s a salvo. Sientes calidez. Has terminado por hoy.",
        "You can already afford this. Today is the day you go and get it.": "Ya puedes permit\xEDrtelo. Hoy es el d\xEDa de ir a por ello.",
        "You carry this feeling. It is not outside you. It never was.": "Llevas esta sensaci\xF3n contigo. No est\xE1 fuera de ti. Nunca lo estuvo.",
        "You did enough. Rest is part of the system, not a break from it.": "Has hecho suficiente. El descanso forma parte del sistema, no es una pausa en \xE9l.",
        "You did not wish for this. You earned it, one decision at a time.": "No te limitaste a desearlo. Te lo ganaste, una decisi\xF3n a la vez.",
        "You do not have to act on the urge. Watch it rise, like a wave. Watch it fall. It always falls.": "No tienes que obedecer al impulso. Observa c\xF3mo sube, como una ola. Observa c\xF3mo baja. Siempre baja.",
        "You do not have to conquer the entire mountain today\u2014only take the next deliberate step with the presence of one who knows they will arrive at {dName}.": "No tienes que conquistar toda la monta\xF1a hoy\u2014solo dar el siguiente paso consciente con la presencia de quien sabe que llegar\xE1 a {dName}.",
        "You do not rise to the level of your financial hopes; you fall to the discipline of your daily margin.": "No alcanzas el nivel de tus esperanzas financieras; llegas al nivel de disciplina de tu margen diario.",
        "You do not rise to the level of your goals. You fall to the level of your systems.": "No alcanzas el nivel de tus objetivos. Caes al nivel de tus sistemas.",
        "You don't have to finish. You have to continue.": "No tienes que terminar. Tienes que continuar.",
        "You don't need motivation. You need the first two minutes. Start there.": "No necesitas motivaci\xF3n. Necesitas los primeros dos minutos. Empieza ah\xED.",
        "You have attained this milestone in real life or completed its full simulation cycle.": "Has alcanzado este hito en la vida real o completado todo su ciclo de simulaci\xF3n.",
        "You have completed {n} minutes of focus. Ending now will release the app lock without logging a verified completion.": "Has completado {n} minutos de concentraci\xF3n. Terminar ahora desbloquear\xE1 la aplicaci\xF3n sin registrar una finalizaci\xF3n verificada.",
        "You have kept your word before. Do it again, quietly, this morning.": "Ya has cumplido tu palabra antes. Hazlo de nuevo esta ma\xF1ana, sin hacer ruido.",
        "You have never made a backup.": "Nunca has hecho una copia de seguridad.",
        "You have not completed any missions under this filter yet.": "Todav\xEDa no has completado ninguna misi\xF3n con este filtro.",
        "You haven't answered the eight \"life you're allowing\" questions yet.": 'Todav\xEDa no has respondido a las ocho preguntas sobre "la vida que est\xE1s permitiendo".',
        "You haven't set today's One Decision yet.": "Todav\xEDa no has definido la Decisi\xF3n de hoy.",
        "You held the standard for {n} minutes of deep craftsmanship.": "Has mantenido tu nivel durante {n} minutos de trabajo profundo y cuidado.",
        "You need D$ {n} more.": "Necesitas D$ {n} m\xE1s.",
        "You're one decision away. Not someday \u2014 today.": "Est\xE1s a una decisi\xF3n. No alg\xFAn d\xEDa \u2014 hoy.",
        "You've reached today's 5 paid daily quests. Mission completed and recorded toward your Future Life!": "Has alcanzado las 5 misiones diarias remuneradas de hoy. \xA1Misi\xF3n completada y registrada para tu Vida Futura!",
        "Your Custom Categories": "Tus categor\xEDas personalizadas",
        "Your First Concrete Real-World Step": "Tu primer paso concreto en el mundo real",
        "Your Future Life Gallery is Empty": "Tu galer\xEDa de Vida Futura est\xE1 vac\xEDa",
        "Your Future Life Score is {score}/100. Your current actions are not yet supporting the future you described. That is information, not a verdict \u2014 and it is exactly what this app is for.": "Tu puntuaci\xF3n de Vida Futura es {score}/100. Tus acciones actuales a\xFAn no sostienen el futuro que has descrito. Es informaci\xF3n, no una sentencia \u2014 y para eso est\xE1 precisamente esta aplicaci\xF3n.",
        "Your Future Self ({futureRole}) has already overcome today's micro-resistances.": "Tu yo del futuro ({futureRole}) ya ha superado las peque\xF1as resistencias de hoy.",
        "Your Two Futures Compass": "Tu Br\xFAjula de Dos Futuros",
        "Your Vision Board Is Empty": "Tu Tablero de Visi\xF3n est\xE1 vac\xEDo",
        "Your anchor execution pillar. Pair developing routines directly after these habits for seamless habit stacking.": "Tu pilar de acci\xF3n consolidado. A\xF1ade rutinas en desarrollo justo despu\xE9s de estos h\xE1bitos para encadenarlos sin esfuerzo.",
        "Your brain has been trained to expect a reward every few seconds. Right now, you are retraining it.": "Tu cerebro ha aprendido a esperar una recompensa cada pocos segundos. Ahora mismo lo est\xE1s reeducando.",
        "Your breath is slow and deep, like waves rolling onto a quiet shore.": "Tu respiraci\xF3n es lenta y profunda, como olas que llegan a una orilla tranquila.",
        "Your chest rises and falls on its own. Each exhale lets the body sink a little deeper.": "Tu pecho sube y baja por s\xED solo. Cada exhalaci\xF3n deja que el cuerpo se hunda un poco m\xE1s.",
        "Your current actions are largely supporting the future you want. The work now is protecting what works.": "Tus acciones actuales sostienen en gran medida el futuro que deseas. Ahora toca proteger lo que funciona.",
        "Your data lives only in this browser.": "Tus datos viven solo en este navegador.",
        "Your dominant internal monologue sculpts your physical perception and choices.": "Tu di\xE1logo interior dominante moldea tu percepci\xF3n f\xEDsica y tus decisiones.",
        "Your emotional anchor and future-self standard.": "Tu ancla emocional y el est\xE1ndar de tu yo del futuro.",
        "Your external life is a trailing indicator of your internal standards and beliefs.": "Tu vida exterior refleja con retraso tus est\xE1ndares y creencias interiores.",
        "Your future is not decided by grand once-a-year resolutions, but by the private standards you uphold when nobody is watching.": "Tu futuro no lo deciden los grandes prop\xF3sitos anuales, sino los est\xE1ndares privados que mantienes cuando nadie mira.",
        "Your future is not forged in occasional marathons\u2014it is constructed by making and executing exactly": "Tu futuro no se forja en maratones ocasionales\u2014se construye tomando y ejecutando exactamente",
        "Your future self is already awake. Give them one thing to be proud of by tonight.": "Tu yo del futuro ya est\xE1 despierto. Dale algo de lo que sentirse orgulloso esta noche.",
        "Your future self is watching this exact moment. Every hour you waste, they lose. Every hour you invest, they win.": "Tu yo del futuro observa este preciso momento. Cada hora que desperdicias, la pierde. Cada hora que inviertes, la gana.",
        "Your highest output area currently.": "Tu \xE1rea de mayor rendimiento actual.",
        "Your highest-momentum life domain this week is": "El \xE1rea de tu vida con m\xE1s impulso esta semana es",
        "Your immutable ledger of symbolic earnings, marketplace expenditures, and savings momentum.": "Tu registro inmutable de ganancias simb\xF3licas, gastos en el mercado e impulso de ahorro.",
