        "The operation was stopped.": "Operaci\xF3n detenida.",
        "Your device couldn't free up enough memory for the AI. Close other tabs and try restarting the coach.": "Tu dispositivo no pudo liberar suficiente memoria para la IA. Cierra otras pesta\xF1as e intenta reiniciar el coach.",
        "The model files couldn't be loaded. Check your internet connection and your browser's free storage, then try again.": "No se pudieron cargar los archivos del modelo. Revisa tu conexi\xF3n a internet y el espacio libre del navegador, y vuelve a intentarlo.",
        "This browser or device doesn't support the AI engine. Try again in an up-to-date browser with WebGPU support.": "Este navegador o dispositivo no admite el motor de IA. Vuelve a intentarlo en un navegador actualizado con WebGPU.",
        "The AI couldn't finish its reply. Restart the coach and try again.": "La IA no pudo terminar su respuesta. Reinicia el coach y vuelve a intentarlo.",
