        "An example": "Un ejemplo",
        "Some courses are not yet available in your language; they open in the language they were written in.": "Algunos cursos a\xFAn no est\xE1n en tu idioma; se abren en el idioma en que se escribieron.",
        "Drained": "Agotado",
