        "Edit how you are arriving": "Editar c\xF3mo llegas",
        "How are you arriving?": "\xBFC\xF3mo llegas hoy?",
        "Tap your energy. It takes one second.": "Toca tu energ\xEDa. Lleva un segundo.",
        "Low energy is a fine place to start. Make today\u2019s decision the 2-minute version.": "Con poca energ\xEDa tambi\xE9n se puede empezar. Haz la decisi\xF3n de hoy en su versi\xF3n de 2 minutos.",
        "On a low day, choose something very small. It still counts.": "En un d\xEDa bajo, elige algo muy peque\xF1o. Tambi\xE9n cuenta.",
        "Today\u2019s decision is kept. Rest counts too. A few quiet minutes might help.": "Cumpliste la decisi\xF3n de hoy. Descansar tambi\xE9n cuenta. Unos minutos de calma pueden ayudar.",
        "Open the Sound Room": "Abrir la Sala de Sonido",
        "Go gently today. Make the decision the 2-minute version, or start with a few quiet minutes.": "Ve con suavidad hoy. Haz la decisi\xF3n en su versi\xF3n de 2 minutos, o empieza con unos minutos de calma.",
        "A steady day. Do today\u2019s decision first, and let the rest follow.": "Un d\xEDa estable. Haz primero la decisi\xF3n de hoy y deja que lo dem\xE1s siga.",
        "A steady day is a good day to keep things simple.": "Un d\xEDa estable es bueno para mantener las cosas simples.",
        "You have some energy today. A short lesson is a good way to use it.": "Hoy tienes algo de energ\xEDa. Una lecci\xF3n corta es una buena forma de usarla.",
        "Open: {title}": "Abrir: {title}",
        "Open a lesson": "Abrir una lecci\xF3n",
        "And your mood? Optional.": "\xBFY tu estado de \xE1nimo? Opcional.",
        "One line about today": "Una l\xEDnea sobre hoy",
        "Whatever stayed with you. It goes into your notebook.": "Lo que se qued\xF3 contigo. Se guarda en tu cuaderno.",
        "Today I\u2026": "Hoy yo\u2026",
        "Added to today\u2019s page in your notebook.": "A\xF1adido a la p\xE1gina de hoy en tu cuaderno.",
        "Today\u2019s prompt": "La pregunta de hoy",
        "Use this prompt": "Usar esta pregunta",
        "{month}: written on {n} of {total} days so far. Days: {days}.": "{month}: has escrito {n} de {total} d\xEDas hasta ahora. D\xEDas: {days}.",
        "{month}: no writing yet this month.": "{month}: a\xFAn no hay escritos este mes.",
        "What is one small thing that went better than I expected this week?": "\xBFQu\xE9 peque\xF1a cosa sali\xF3 mejor de lo que esperaba esta semana?",
        "Which promise to myself am I quietly proud of keeping?": "\xBFQu\xE9 promesa que me hice me enorgullece haber cumplido, en silencio?",
        "What would I do today if I trusted myself a little more?": "\xBFQu\xE9 har\xEDa hoy si confiara un poco m\xE1s en m\xED?",
        "Who has made my life easier lately, and what would I like them to know?": "\xBFQui\xE9n me ha hecho la vida m\xE1s f\xE1cil \xFAltimamente y qu\xE9 me gustar\xEDa que supiera?",
        "What am I carrying that I could set down for one evening?": "\xBFQu\xE9 estoy cargando que podr\xEDa dejar por una noche?",
        "Describe a moment today when I felt most like myself.": "Describe un momento de hoy en el que me sent\xED m\xE1s yo mismo.",
        "What is the kindest thing I could say to myself right now?": "\xBFQu\xE9 es lo m\xE1s amable que podr\xEDa decirme ahora mismo?",
        "What did I avoid this week, and what is the smallest first step toward it?": "\xBFQu\xE9 evit\xE9 esta semana y cu\xE1l es el primer paso m\xE1s peque\xF1o hacia ello?",
        "Which ordinary part of my day would I miss if it were gone?": "\xBFQu\xE9 parte ordinaria de mi d\xEDa echar\xEDa de menos si desapareciera?",
        "What do I want more of in my days, and what could I do about it today?": "\xBFQu\xE9 quiero m\xE1s en mis d\xEDas y qu\xE9 podr\xEDa hacer hoy al respecto?",
        "When did I last feel calm, and what was around me?": "\xBFCu\xE1ndo me sent\xED en calma por \xFAltima vez y qu\xE9 hab\xEDa a mi alrededor?",
        "What is a decision I made recently that I would make again?": "\xBFQu\xE9 decisi\xF3n tom\xE9 hace poco que volver\xEDa a tomar?",
        "What am I learning about myself that I did not know a year ago?": "\xBFQu\xE9 estoy aprendiendo sobre m\xED que no sab\xEDa hace un a\xF1o?",
        "Write about a place where I feel safe, and what makes it so.": "Escribe sobre un lugar donde me siento seguro y qu\xE9 lo hace as\xED.",
        "What would a good day look like, in detail, from waking to sleep?": "\xBFC\xF3mo ser\xEDa un buen d\xEDa, en detalle, desde que despierto hasta que duermo?",
        "Which worry is loudest today, and what is actually within my control?": "\xBFQu\xE9 preocupaci\xF3n suena m\xE1s fuerte hoy y qu\xE9 est\xE1 realmente en mi mano?",
        "What is one thing I can forgive myself for?": "\xBFDe qu\xE9 cosa puedo perdonarme?",
        "Who do I want to become a little more like, and what do they do differently?": "\xBFA qui\xE9n quiero parecerme un poco m\xE1s y qu\xE9 hace de forma distinta?",
