        "9,000 rpm": "9,000 rpm",
        "A 1080\xD71350 image \u2014 perfect for Stories or a lock screen.": "1080\xD71350 boyutunda bir g\xF6rsel \u2014 Hik\xE2yeler veya kilit ekran\u0131 i\xE7in ideal.",
        "A 120 ft superyacht anchored in a forest bay \u2014 floating privacy with a helipad and a chef.": "Ormanl\u0131k bir koyda demirli 120 ft s\xFCperyat \u2014 helikopter pisti ve \u015Fefiyle su \xFCst\xFCnde mahremiyet.",
        "A 40 ft performance sailing yacht moored under green mountains, built for northern waters.": "Ye\u015Fil da\u011Flar\u0131n ete\u011Finde demirli 40 ft performans yelkenlisi, kuzey sular\u0131 i\xE7in tasarland\u0131.",
        "A 45 ft catamaran with crew for ten days: flat sailing, turquoise water, snorkeling off the stern.": "On g\xFCn boyunca m\xFCrettebatl\u0131 45 ft katamaran: sakin seyir, turkuaz sular, k\u0131\xE7tan dal\u0131p \u015Fnorkelle ke\u015Fif.",
        "A Letter From Your Default Self": "Ak\u0131\u015F\u0131na B\u0131rakt\u0131\u011F\u0131n Benli\u011Finden Bir Mektup",
        "A PADI open-water course over living coral \u2014 a new world unlocked in four days.": "Canl\u0131 mercanlar\u0131n \xFCzerinde PADI a\xE7\u0131k deniz kursu \u2014 d\xF6rt g\xFCnde yepyeni bir d\xFCnyan\u0131n kap\u0131lar\u0131 a\xE7\u0131l\u0131r.",
        "A Personal Transformation & Future Life OS": "Ki\u015Fisel D\xF6n\xFC\u015F\xFCm ve Gelecekteki Hayat\u0131n\u0131n \u0130\u015Fletim Sistemi",
        "A Tuesday in 5 years": "5 y\u0131l sonra bir sal\u0131",
        "A blue 911 used the way it should be \u2014 dusty, driven, loved.": "Olmas\u0131 gerekti\u011Fi gibi kullan\u0131lan mavi bir 911 \u2014 tozlu, yollarda, sevilen.",
        "A calm evening is a decision too. Phone down, lights low, mind quiet.": "Sakin bir ak\u015Fam da bir karard\u0131r. Telefonu b\u0131rak, \u0131\u015F\u0131klar\u0131 k\u0131s, zihnini dinlendir.",
        "A calm voice guides you step by step over a frequency soundscape. Relaxation, dopamine reset, manifestation, belief, motivation and more.": "Sakin bir ses, frekanslardan olu\u015Fan bir ses ortam\u0131nda sana ad\u0131m ad\u0131m rehberlik eder. Gev\u015Feme, dopamin s\u0131f\u0131rlama, hayallerini ger\xE7ekle\u015Ftirme, inan\xE7, motivasyon ve daha fazlas\u0131.",
        "A calm, honest record of your executions, consistency, and life direction.": "Eylemlerinin, istikrar\u0131n\u0131n ve ya\u015Fam y\xF6n\xFCn\xFCn sakin, d\xFCr\xFCst bir kayd\u0131.",
        "A car for living, not for storing.": "Garajda saklamak i\xE7in de\u011Fil, ya\u015Famak i\xE7in bir araba.",
        "A car-free alpine week under the Matterhorn: skiing or hiking by day, fondue and stars by night.": "Matterhorn'un ete\u011Finde ara\xE7s\u0131z bir Alp haftas\u0131: g\xFCnd\xFCz kayak veya y\xFCr\xFCy\xFC\u015F, gece fond\xFC ve y\u0131ld\u0131zlar.",
        "A champion is defined not by their wins but by how they can recover when they fall.": "Bir \u015Fampiyonu tan\u0131mlayan zaferleri de\u011Fil, d\xFC\u015Ft\xFC\u011F\xFCnde nas\u0131l toparland\u0131\u011F\u0131d\u0131r.",
        "A concrete physical action you can take this week.": "Bu hafta atabilece\u011Fin somut bir fiziksel ad\u0131m.",
        "A custom vision goal seen in real life or discovered online.": "Ger\xE7ek hayatta g\xF6rd\xFC\u011F\xFCn veya internette ke\u015Ffetti\u011Fin \xF6zel bir vizyon hedefi.",
        "A dawn you'll never forget.": "Hi\xE7 unutamayaca\u011F\u0131n bir \u015Fafak.",
        "A day in the built life": "\u0130n\u015Fa etti\u011Fin hayatta bir g\xFCn",
        "A day of untouched powder reached by helicopter \u2014 five runs you'll talk about forever.": "Helikopterle ula\u015F\u0131lan el de\u011Fmemi\u015F toz karda bir g\xFCn \u2014 \xF6m\xFCr boyu anlataca\u011F\u0131n be\u015F ini\u015F.",
        "A dedicated minimalist studio space with acoustic treatment, dual ultra-wide displays, drafting bench, and zero clutter.": "Akustik d\xFCzenlemeli, \xE7ift ultra geni\u015F ekranl\u0131, \xE7izim masal\u0131 ve tamamen d\xFCzenli, sana \xF6zel minimalist bir st\xFCdyo.",
        "A finished draft is worth ten masterpieces existing only in your imagination.": "Bitmi\u015F bir taslak, yaln\u0131zca hayalinde var olan on ba\u015Fyap\u0131ttan de\u011Ferlidir.",
        "A floatplane charter to a lake with no road \u2014 a lodge, a canoe, and total silence.": "Karayolu olmayan bir g\xF6le deniz u\xE7a\u011F\u0131yla yolculuk \u2014 bir kul\xFCbe, bir kano ve tam bir sessizlik.",
        "A glass corner office over the city for the company you built \u2014 quiet, bright, and yours.": "Kurdu\u011Fun \u015Firket i\xE7in \u015Fehre bakan cam bir k\xF6\u015Fe ofis \u2014 sessiz, ayd\u0131nl\u0131k ve senin.",
        "A guided night under the aurora, thermal suits, a fire, and a photographer to capture it.": "Kuzey \u0131\u015F\u0131klar\u0131 alt\u0131nda rehberli bir gece, termal k\u0131yafetler, ate\u015F ve an\u0131 yakalayan bir foto\u011Fraf\xE7\u0131.",
        "A higher income without automated savings and clear allocation merely increases high-stress consumption. Guard your cash flow relentlessly.": "Otomatik birikim ve net bir da\u011F\u0131l\u0131m olmadan y\xFCkselen gelir, yaln\u0131zca stresli t\xFCketimi art\u0131r\u0131r. Nakit ak\u0131\u015F\u0131n\u0131 kararl\u0131l\u0131kla koru.",
        "A home base where everyone feels held and nobody feels crowded.": "Herkesin kendini g\xFCvende hissetti\u011Fi, kimsenin s\u0131k\u0131\u015Fmad\u0131\u011F\u0131 bir yuva.",
        "A home that makes people want to come over, and stay.": "\u0130nsanlar\u0131n gelmek ve kalmak istedi\u011Fi bir ev.",
        "A life that smells of lemons and salt.": "Limon ve tuz kokan bir hayat.",
        "A light jet for a week of meetings across three capitals \u2014 no queues, no lost days.": "\xDC\xE7 ba\u015Fkentte bir haftal\u0131k toplant\u0131lar i\xE7in hafif jet \u2014 s\u0131ra yok, kay\u0131p g\xFCn yok.",
        "A light jet with a two-pilot crew: six seats, 3,000 km range, your schedule.": "\u0130ki pilotlu hafif jet: alt\u0131 koltuk, 3,000 km menzil, senin program\u0131n.",
        "A long oak table, good chairs, a screen that works \u2014 the room where your team decides things.": "Uzun bir me\u015Fe masa, rahat sandalyeler, sorunsuz bir ekran \u2014 ekibinin karar ald\u0131\u011F\u0131 oda.",
        "A long weekend in a cliffside village: hiking between towns, swimming from rocks, pasta at sunset.": "U\xE7urum kenar\u0131ndaki bir k\xF6yde uzun hafta sonu: kasabalar aras\u0131 y\xFCr\xFCy\xFC\u015F, kayal\u0131klardan denize giri\u015F, g\xFCn bat\u0131m\u0131nda makarna.",
        "A new 45 ft cruising catamaran \u2014 a floating home that can cross oceans.": "Yeni bir 45 ft gezi katamaran\u0131 \u2014 okyanuslar\u0131 a\u015Fabilen y\xFCzen bir ev.",
        "A one-way private flight on an empty leg \u2014 the private-jet experience at a fraction of the cost.": "Bo\u015F d\xF6n\xFC\u015F u\xE7u\u015Funda tek y\xF6n \xF6zel u\xE7u\u015F \u2014 maliyetin k\xFC\xE7\xFCk bir k\u0131sm\u0131na \xF6zel jet deneyimi.",
        "A periodic diagnostic of the 8 essential foundations of your life.": "Hayat\u0131n\u0131n 8 temel dayana\u011F\u0131n\u0131 d\xFCzenli olarak de\u011Ferlendirme.",
        "A person with vitality wants a thousand things; a person without it wants only one.": "Ya\u015Fam enerjisi olan insan bin \u015Fey ister; olmayan yaln\u0131zca bir \u015Fey.",
        "A personally crafted luxury milestone for My Future Life.": "Gelecekteki Hayat\u0131m i\xE7in ki\u015Fiye \xF6zel haz\u0131rlanm\u0131\u015F l\xFCks bir d\xF6n\xFCm noktas\u0131.",
        "A place for the part of you that isn't for sale.": "\u0130\xE7indeki sat\u0131l\u0131k olmayan par\xE7aya ait bir yer.",
        "A place friends fly in for.": "Arkada\u015Flar\u0131n\u0131n u\xE7akla geldi\u011Fi bir yer.",
        "A place where the family gathers every year, no matter what.": "Ne olursa olsun ailenin her y\u0131l bulu\u015Ftu\u011Fu bir yer.",
        "A prancing horse at full stride on an empty mountain road \u2014 the drive you promise yourself.": "Bo\u015F bir da\u011F yolunda t\xFCm g\xFCc\xFCyle ko\u015Fan \u015Fahlanm\u0131\u015F bir at \u2014 kendine s\xF6z verdi\u011Fin s\xFCr\xFC\u015F.",
        "A preview of the life, for the price of a weekend.": "Bir hafta sonu fiyat\u0131na o hayat\u0131n \xF6n g\xF6sterimi.",
        "A private balloon flight over a valley at sunrise with champagne on landing.": "G\xFCn do\u011Fumunda vadi \xFCzerinde \xF6zel balon u\xE7u\u015Fu ve ini\u015Fte \u015Fampanya.",
        "A private barrel-room tasting with the winemaker, then lunch in the vines.": "\u015Earap \xFCreticisiyle f\u0131\xE7\u0131 mahzeninde \xF6zel tad\u0131m, ard\u0131ndan ba\u011Flarda \xF6\u011Fle yeme\u011Fi.",
        "A private box at the races, tailoring and champagne, and a day that feels like another century.": "Yar\u0131\u015Flarda \xF6zel loca, \xF6zel dikim k\u0131yafetler ve \u015Fampanya; ba\u015Fka bir y\xFCzy\u0131ldaym\u0131\u015F gibi hissettiren bir g\xFCn.",
        "A private helicopter flight over glaciers and peaks, with a landing on the snow for lunch.": "Buzullar ve zirveler \xFCzerinde \xF6zel helikopter u\xE7u\u015Fu, \xF6\u011Fle yeme\u011Fi i\xE7in kar \xFCst\xFCne ini\u015F.",
        "A private-island resort reached by seaplane \u2014 sandbank dinners, dolphins at dusk.": "Deniz u\xE7a\u011F\u0131yla ula\u015F\u0131lan \xF6zel ada tesisi \u2014 kum s\u0131\u011Fl\u0131\u011F\u0131nda ak\u015Fam yemekleri, alacakaranl\u0131kta yunuslar.",
        "A rented private office in a good building: one desk, one door, zero interruptions.": "\u0130yi bir binada kiral\u0131k \xF6zel ofis: bir masa, bir kap\u0131, s\u0131f\u0131r kesinti.",
        "A road trip through fishing villages and fjords with a rorbu cabin every night and the sea at the doorstep.": "Bal\u0131k\xE7\u0131 k\xF6yleri ve fiyortlardan ge\xE7en bir yolculuk; her gece bir rorbu kul\xFCbesi, kap\u0131n\u0131n \xF6n\xFCnde deniz.",
        "A room for the mind \u2014 the best investment in the house.": "Zihne ayr\u0131lm\u0131\u015F bir oda \u2014 evin en iyi yat\u0131r\u0131m\u0131.",
        "A short pre-work session that empties mental clutter and sets a single, sharp intention before deep work.": "Zihinsel da\u011F\u0131n\u0131kl\u0131\u011F\u0131 temizleyen, derin \xE7al\u0131\u015Fmadan \xF6nce tek ve net bir niyet belirleyen k\u0131sa haz\u0131rl\u0131k seans\u0131.",
        "A short rationale to reinforce motivation during resistance.": "Diren\xE7le kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131\u011F\u0131nda motivasyonunu g\xFC\xE7lendirecek k\u0131sa bir gerek\xE7e.",
        "A single completed micro-task creates more neurological momentum than ten master outlines.": "Tamamlanan tek bir mikro g\xF6rev, on kapsaml\u0131 plandan daha fazla n\xF6rolojik ivme yarat\u0131r.",
        "A skill that opens the other 70% of the planet.": "Gezegenin kalan %70'ini a\xE7an bir beceri.",
        "A skippered week among the Dalmatian islands \u2014 anchor in a new cove every night.": "Dalma\xE7ya adalar\u0131nda kaptanl\u0131 bir hafta \u2014 her gece yeni bir koyda demirle.",
        "A slow body scan that releases tension from head to toe and settles the nervous system.": "Ba\u015Ftan aya\u011Fa gerginli\u011Fi b\u0131rakt\u0131ran, sinir sistemini sakinle\u015Ftiren yava\u015F bir beden taramas\u0131.",
        "A slower, richer, more generous life.": "Daha yava\u015F, daha zengin, daha c\xF6mert bir hayat.",
        "A small, daily reminder that you keep your word.": "S\xF6z\xFCn\xFC tuttu\u011Funu hat\u0131rlatan k\xFC\xE7\xFCk, g\xFCnl\xFCk bir i\u015Faret.",
        "A soft, slow session that reviews the day with kindness and guides the body toward deep sleep.": "G\xFCn\xFC \u015Fefkatle de\u011Ferlendiren ve bedeni derin uykuya haz\u0131rlayan yumu\u015Fak, yava\u015F bir seans.",
        "A space so quiet it does the thinking with you.": "Seninle birlikte d\xFC\u015F\xFCnecek kadar sessiz bir alan.",
        "A super-jeep chase for the northern lights, glacier caves, and hot springs under the snow.": "Kuzey \u0131\u015F\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131, buzul ma\u011Faralar\u0131n\u0131 ve kar alt\u0131ndaki kapl\u0131calar\u0131 ke\u015Ffetmek i\xE7in s\xFCper jip yolculu\u011Fu.",
        "A tiny cabin among trees with a desk, a stove and no signal \u2014 where the book gets written.": "A\u011Fa\xE7lar aras\u0131nda masa ve sobas\u0131 olan, telefon \xE7ekmeyen k\xFC\xE7\xFCk bir kul\xFCbe \u2014 kitab\u0131n yaz\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131 yer.",
        "A tool for keeping promises.": "S\xF6zlerini tutman\u0131 sa\u011Flayan bir ara\xE7.",
        "A twelve-course tasting menu at a three-star restaurant with wine pairing.": "\xDC\xE7 y\u0131ld\u0131zl\u0131 bir restoranda \u015Farap e\u015Fle\u015Fmeli on iki a\u015Famal\u0131 tad\u0131m men\xFCs\xFC.",
        "A used but sound 30-footer: sleeps four, coastal cruising, weekends that cost only wind.": "Kullan\u0131lm\u0131\u015F ama sa\u011Flam bir 30 ft tekne: d\xF6rt ki\u015Filik yatak, k\u0131y\u0131 seyri, bedeli yaln\u0131zca r\xFCzg\xE2r olan hafta sonlar\u0131.",
        "A vivid visualization of your future self and your dream life, so your daily decisions start pointing there.": "G\xFCnl\xFCk kararlar\u0131n\u0131 o y\xF6ne \xE7evirmek i\xE7in gelecekteki benli\u011Fini ve hayalindeki hayat\u0131 canl\u0131 bi\xE7imde g\xF6z\xFCnde canland\u0131r.",
        "A warm, uplifting session that raises your mood through breath, memory and a gentle inner smile.": "Nefes, an\u0131lar ve i\xE7ten gelen hafif bir g\xFCl\xFCmsemeyle ruh halini y\xFCkselten s\u0131cak, canland\u0131r\u0131c\u0131 bir seans.",
        "A week in Positano with a private boat to Capri, lemon groves, and dinner on the water.": "Positano'da bir hafta; Capri'ye \xF6zel tekne, limon bah\xE7eleri ve su \xFCst\xFCnde ak\u015Fam yeme\u011Fi.",
        "A week in a Left Bank apartment: markets, museums, long dinners and walks with no destination.": "Left Bank'te bir dairede bir hafta: pazarlar, m\xFCzeler, uzun ak\u015Fam yemekleri ve hedefsiz y\xFCr\xFCy\xFC\u015Fler.",
        "A week in a high-floor hotel with a skyline view, Broadway, galleries and 5 a.m. runs along the river.": "\u015Eehir manzaral\u0131 y\xFCksek katl\u0131 bir otelde bir hafta; Broadway, galeriler ve sabah 5'te nehir boyunca ko\u015Fular.",
        "A week on a crewed 30 m motor yacht: Monaco to Saint-Tropez with a chef, tender and toys.": "M\xFCrettebatl\u0131 30 m motor yatta bir hafta: \u015Fef, servis botu ve su oyuncaklar\u0131yla Monaco'dan Saint-Tropez'ye.",
