        "Book a viewing trip and compare Dubai residency routes.": "Bir ev g\xF6rme gezisi ay\u0131rt ve Dubai oturum se\xE7eneklerini kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131r.",
        "Book for September when the winds are kind.": "R\xFCzg\xE2rlar\u0131n yumu\u015Fak oldu\u011Fu eyl\xFCl i\xE7in rezervasyon yap.",
        "Book for a clear-sky day in early spring.": "\u0130lkbahar ba\u015F\u0131nda g\xF6ky\xFCz\xFCn\xFCn a\xE7\u0131k oldu\u011Fu bir g\xFCn i\xE7in rezervasyon yap.",
        "Book for late September \u2014 fewer crowds, warm sea.": "Eyl\xFCl sonu i\xE7in rezervasyon yap \u2014 daha az kalabal\u0131k, s\u0131cak deniz.",
        "Book in the new-moon week for the darkest skies.": "En karanl\u0131k g\xF6ky\xFCz\xFC i\xE7in yeni ay haftas\u0131nda rezervasyon yap.",
        "Book it for the day after a big milestone.": "B\xFCy\xFCk bir d\xF6n\xFCm noktas\u0131n\u0131n ertesi g\xFCn\xFC i\xE7in ay\u0131rt.",
        "Book it for the next quarter-end as a reward.": "Bir sonraki \xE7eyrek sonuna \xF6d\xFCl olarak ay\u0131rt.",
        "Book optimal solar cycle observation window and arrange expedition gear.": "En uygun g\xFCne\u015F d\xF6ng\xFCs\xFC g\xF6zlem aral\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 ay\u0131rt ve ke\u015Fif ekipman\u0131n\u0131 haz\u0131rla.",
        "Book summer charter along C\xF4te d'Azur to inspect prime coastal parcels.": "Se\xE7kin k\u0131y\u0131 arazilerini incelemek i\xE7in C\xF4te d'Azur boyunca yazl\u0131k tekne kirala.",
        "Book the balloon for two mornings \u2014 weather cancels one in three.": "Balonu iki sabah i\xE7in ay\u0131rt \u2014 u\xE7u\u015Flar\u0131n \xFC\xE7te biri hava nedeniyle iptal oluyor.",
        "Book the boat first; hotels follow.": "\xD6nce tekneyi ay\u0131rt; oteller sonra gelir.",
        "Book the cabins early; summer sells out.": "Kul\xFCbeleri erken ay\u0131rt; yaz\u0131n yer kalm\u0131yor.",
        "Book the course; the rest of the trip follows.": "Kursu ay\u0131rt; gezinin kalan\u0131 \u015Fekillenir.",
        "Book the ryokan and omakase first; both sell out.": "\xD6nce ryokan ve omakase ay\u0131rt; ikisinde de yer kalm\u0131yor.",
        "Book the tee time six months ahead.": "Golf ba\u015Flang\u0131\xE7 saatini alt\u0131 ay \xF6nceden ay\u0131rt.",
        "Boredom tolerance": "S\u0131k\u0131lmaya dayan\u0131kl\u0131l\u0131k",
        "Boundaries & Standards": "S\u0131n\u0131rlar ve Standartlar",
        "Boutique": "Butik",
        "Boutique Pick-Up Day": "Butikten Teslim Alma G\xFCn\xFC",
        "Box Breathing (4-4-4-4): {state}": "Kutu Nefesi (4-4-4-4): {state}",
        "Box Breathing / Parasympathetic Reset": "Kutu Nefesi / Parasempatik Yenilenme",
        "Box breathing: inhale for 4 seconds, hold for 4, exhale for 4, and rest for 4.": "Kutu nefesi: 4 saniye nefes al, 4 saniye tut, 4 saniye ver ve 4 saniye dinlen.",
        "Brass Details": "Pirin\xE7 Detaylar",
        "Breaks initial inertia.": "Ba\u015Flang\u0131\xE7taki ataleti k\u0131rar.",
        "Breakthrough": "At\u0131l\u0131m",
        "Breathe In": "Nefes Al",
        "Breathe Out": "Nefes Ver",
        "Breathe deeply and slowly. Confident people breathe slowly. Let your breath teach your body.": "Derin ve yava\u015F nefes al. Kendine g\xFCvenen insanlar yava\u015F nefes al\u0131r. Nefesin bedenine \xF6\u011Fretsin.",
        "Breathe deeply. Approach your next task with calm, centered poise.": "Derin nefes al. S\u0131radaki i\u015Fine sakin ve dengeli bir duru\u015Fla yakla\u015F.",
        "Breathe in for four. Out for six. Let the breathing slow down the mind.": "D\xF6rde kadar sayarak al. Alt\u0131ya kadar sayarak ver. Nefes zihnini yava\u015Flats\u0131n.",
        "Breathe in for four... hold for four... and out for six. Slow the whole system down.": "D\xF6rde kadar sayarak nefes al... d\xF6rde kadar tut... alt\u0131ya kadar ver. T\xFCm sistemini yava\u015Flat.",
        "Breathe in gently... and let out a long, slow exhale. Let each breath be a little slower than the last.": "Yumu\u015Fak\xE7a nefes al... uzun ve yava\u015F bir nefes ver. Her nefes bir \xF6ncekinden biraz daha yava\u015F olsun.",
        "Breathe in joy. Breathe out heaviness. Breathe in lightness. Breathe out worry.": "Ne\u015Feyi i\xE7ine \xE7ek. A\u011F\u0131rl\u0131\u011F\u0131 b\u0131rak. Hafifli\u011Fi i\xE7ine \xE7ek. Kayg\u0131y\u0131 b\u0131rak.",
        "Breathe in power. Breathe out excuses. Breathe in fire. Breathe out hesitation.": "G\xFCc\xFC i\xE7ine \xE7ek. Bahaneleri b\u0131rak. Ate\u015Fi i\xE7ine \xE7ek. Teredd\xFCd\xFC b\u0131rak.",
        "Breathe in strength. Breathe out doubt. One more time.": "G\xFCc\xFC i\xE7ine \xE7ek. \u015E\xFCpheyi b\u0131rak. Bir kez daha.",
        "Breathe in through your nose. Breathe out slowly. Let your weight sink downward, rooted and stable.": "Burnundan nefes al. Yava\u015F\xE7a ver. A\u011F\u0131rl\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131n a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131ya yerle\u015Fti\u011Fini hisset; k\xF6kl\xFC ve sa\u011Flam.",
        "Breathe in, and imagine the breath is light. Breathe out, and let that light spread through your chest.": "Nefes al ve nefesinin \u0131\u015F\u0131k oldu\u011Funu hayal et. Nefes ver ve bu \u0131\u015F\u0131\u011F\u0131n g\xF6\u011Fs\xFCne yay\u0131lmas\u0131na izin ver.",
        "Breathe in. Feel the stillness. Breathe out. Let the noise settle like dust in a quiet room.": "Nefes al. Dinginli\u011Fi hisset. Nefes ver. G\xFCr\xFClt\xFC, sessiz bir odadaki toz gibi yere \xE7\xF6ks\xFCn.",
        "Breathe in... and go. Now.": "Nefes al... ve ba\u015Fla. \u015Eimdi.",
        "Breathe into that place. And as you exhale, imagine the story loosening, like an old rope untying.": "Nefesini o b\xF6lgeye y\xF6nlendir. Verirken hik\xE2yenin eski bir ipin d\xFC\u011F\xFCm\xFC \xE7\xF6z\xFCl\xFCr gibi gev\u015Fedi\u011Fini hayal et.",
        "Breathe out the day. It's done. You showed up.": "Nefesinle g\xFCn\xFC b\u0131rak. Bitti. Sen oradayd\u0131n.",
        "Breathe slowly. In through the nose. Out through the mouth. Let the shoulders drop.": "Yava\u015F nefes al. Burundan al. A\u011F\u0131zdan ver. Omuzlar\u0131n d\xFC\u015Fs\xFCn.",
        "Breathe slowly. With each breath, thank your lungs, quietly, for doing this without being asked.": "Yava\u015F nefes al. Her nefeste, senden talimat beklemeden \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131klar\u0131 i\xE7in akci\u011Ferlerine i\xE7inden te\u015Fekk\xFCr et.",
        "Breathe slowly. With each exhale, let today loosen its grip. You are about to travel forward in time.": "Yava\u015F nefes al. Her veri\u015Fte bug\xFCn\xFCn \xFCzerindeki etkisi gev\u015Fesin. Birazdan zamanda ileriye gideceksin.",
        "Breathe. The mind is quiet. The task is clear. The body is ready.": "Nefes al. Zihin sessiz. G\xF6rev a\xE7\u0131k. Beden haz\u0131r.",
        "Breathe... and drift.": "Nefes al... ve kendini b\u0131rak.",
        "Breathing, meditation & mental space decluttering": "Nefes, meditasyon ve zihinsel alan\u0131 d\xFCzenleme",
        'Bridge "{name}" to a real savings and execution plan.': '"{name}" i\xE7in ger\xE7ek bir birikim ve eylem plan\u0131na k\xF6pr\xFC kur.',
        "Brief context on what belongs here.": "Buraya neyin ait oldu\u011Funa dair k\u0131sa a\xE7\u0131klama.",
        "Bright red 1970s coup\xE9, analog everything, pop-up joy.": "Parlak k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 1970'ler kupesi; her \u015Feyi analog, a\xE7\u0131l\u0131r farlar\u0131yla ne\u015Fe kayna\u011F\u0131.",
        "Bring to mind a moment when you felt truly good. A laugh. A sunrise. A hug. A win.": "Kendini ger\xE7ekten iyi hissetti\u011Fin bir an\u0131 hat\u0131rla. Bir kahkaha. Bir g\xFCn do\u011Fumu. Bir sar\u0131lma. Bir ba\u015Far\u0131.",
