        "Describe an ordinary day in the life you want, three years from now.": "\xDC\xE7 y\u0131l sonra istedi\u011Fin hayatta s\u0131radan bir g\xFCn\xFC anlat.",
        "Describe specifics: sensory details, rhythms, boundaries, and concrete freedom.": "Ayr\u0131nt\u0131lar\u0131 anlat: duyusal detaylar, ritimler, s\u0131n\u0131rlar ve somut \xF6zg\xFCrl\xFCk.",
