        "Design how your ideal monthly effort and resources are distributed across life.": "\u0130deal ayl\u0131k \xE7aban\u0131n ve kaynaklar\u0131n\u0131n hayat\u0131na nas\u0131l da\u011F\u0131laca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 tasarla.",
        "Design the bar wall on paper and price the tower's penthouse tier.": "Bar duvar\u0131n\u0131 k\xE2\u011F\u0131tta tasarla ve kulenin \xE7at\u0131 kat\u0131 fiyatlar\u0131n\u0131 ara\u015Ft\u0131r.",
        "Design, light and calm, with the city just outside the glass.": "Tasar\u0131m, \u0131\u015F\u0131k ve sakinlik; cam\u0131n hemen d\u0131\u015F\u0131nda \u015Fehir.",
        "Desk by the Window": "Pencere Kenar\u0131nda Masa",
