        "Developing": "Geli\u015Fiyor",
        "Diagnostic Overview": "De\u011Ferlendirmeye Genel Bak\u0131\u015F",
        "Dialogue Window": "Diyalog Penceresi",
        "Did the default future get a vote today? Honest answer, no judgment.": "Ak\u0131\u015F\u0131na b\u0131rakt\u0131\u011F\u0131n gelecek bug\xFCn bir oy ald\u0131 m\u0131? D\xFCr\xFCst\xE7e yan\u0131tla, yarg\u0131 yok.",
        "Did the default future win today? Log it honestly. Then let it go.": "Bug\xFCn ak\u0131\u015F\u0131na b\u0131rakt\u0131\u011F\u0131n gelecek mi kazand\u0131? D\xFCr\xFCst\xE7e kaydet. Sonra b\u0131rak.",
        "Difficulty": "Zorluk",
        "Direct Completion": "Do\u011Frudan Tamamlama",
        "Direct private dock with mahogany Riva mooring, floor-to-ceiling motorized glass pavilions, infinity pool merging into Lake Como.": "Maun Riva ba\u011Flama alanl\u0131 \xF6zel iskele, yerden tavana motorlu cam k\xF6\u015Fkler ve Lake Como ile birle\u015Fen sonsuzluk havuzu.",
        "Direct private dock, floor-to-ceiling glass pavilions, infinity pool overlooking Bellagio, heated olive gardens.": "Do\u011Frudan \xF6zel iskele, yerden tavana cam k\xF6\u015Fkler, Bellagio manzaral\u0131 sonsuzluk havuzu ve \u0131s\u0131tmal\u0131 zeytin bah\xE7eleri.",
        "Direct private dock, floor-to-ceiling glass pavilions, infinity pool overlooking Bellagio.": "Do\u011Frudan \xF6zel iskele, yerden tavana cam k\xF6\u015Fkler ve Bellagio manzaral\u0131 sonsuzluk havuzu.",
