        "Discipline": "Disiplin",
        "Discipline & Fire": "Disiplin ve Ate\u015F",
        "Discipline & Follow-Through": "Disiplin ve Kararl\u0131l\u0131k",
        "Discipline is choosing between what you want now and what you want most.": "Disiplin, \u015Fu anda istedi\u011Finle en \xE7ok istedi\u011Fin aras\u0131nda se\xE7im yapmakt\u0131r.",
        "Discipline is remembering what you want. So: what do you want?": "Disiplin, ne istedi\u011Fini hat\u0131rlamakt\u0131r. Peki sen ne istiyorsun?",
