        "Display Name": "G\xF6r\xFCnen Ad",
        'Dissolves the old stories of "I can\'t" and replaces them with grounded, quiet certainty in yourself.': 'Eski "yapamam" hik\xE2yelerini \xE7\xF6zer ve yerlerine kendine duydu\u011Fun sa\u011Flam, sessiz g\xFCveni koyar.',
        "Distill Your Two Futures": "\u0130ki Gelece\u011Fini Netle\u015Ftir",
        "Distracted": "Dikkati Da\u011F\u0131n\u0131k",
        "Distraction Parking Lot": "Dikkat Da\u011F\u0131t\u0131c\u0131lar Park\u0131",
        "Distraction urges, boredom, self-doubt, perfectionism.": "Dikkat da\u011F\u0131t\u0131c\u0131 d\xFCrt\xFCler, s\u0131k\u0131lma, kendinden \u015F\xFCphe, m\xFCkemmeliyet\xE7ilik.",
        "Do a one-month Ubud stay and price three villas.": "Ubud'da bir ay kal ve \xFC\xE7 villan\u0131n fiyat\u0131n\u0131 ara\u015Ft\u0131r.",
        "Do an advanced riding course first.": "\xD6nce ileri s\xFCr\xFC\u015F kursuna kat\u0131l.",
        "Do not shrink your standards to fit current circumstances. Grow your daily capacity until {dName} is simply your natural baseline.": "Standartlar\u0131n\u0131 mevcut ko\u015Fullara uydurmak i\xE7in k\xFC\xE7\xFCltme. {dName} do\u011Fal ba\u015Flang\u0131\xE7 d\xFCzeyin olana kadar g\xFCnl\xFCk kapasiteni art\u0131r.",
        'Do not wait; the time will never be "just right." Start where you stand, and work with whatever tools you may have at your command.': 'Bekleme; zaman asla "tam uygun" olmayacak. Bulundu\u011Fun yerden ba\u015Fla ve elindeki ara\xE7larla \xE7al\u0131\u015F.',
