        "Four nights on the marina with a yacht afternoon, desert dinner and a look at the city's ambition up close.": "Marinada d\xF6rt gece; yatta bir \xF6\u011Fleden sonra, \xE7\xF6lde ak\u015Fam yeme\u011Fi ve \u015Fehrin tutkusuna yak\u0131ndan bak\u0131\u015F.",
