        "Hilltop villa bathed in golden sunset light, terraced gardens and a view across vineyards to the next village.": "Alt\u0131n g\xFCn bat\u0131m\u0131 \u0131\u015F\u0131\u011F\u0131yla y\u0131kanan tepe villas\u0131; terasl\u0131 bah\xE7eler ve ba\u011Flar\u0131n \xF6tesindeki k\xF6ye uzanan manzara.",
