        "Hinoki Wood Onsen": "Hinoki Ah\u015Fap Onsen",
        "Hire the first person who needs a seat at it.": "O masada bir koltu\u011Fa ihtiya\xE7 duyan ilk ki\u015Fiyi i\u015Fe al.",
