        "Hold a weekly project retrospective": "Haftal\u0131k proje de\u011Ferlendirmesi yap",
        "Hold it. That is your One Decision. Not for someday. For today.": "Akl\u0131nda tut. Bu senin Tek Karar\u0131n. Bir g\xFCn i\xE7in de\u011Fil. Bug\xFCn i\xE7in.",
        "Hold your boundaries firm against distraction. Your future life is listening to today's habits.": "Dikkat da\u011F\u0131t\u0131c\u0131lara kar\u015F\u0131 s\u0131n\u0131rlar\u0131n\u0131 koru. Gelecekteki hayat\u0131n bug\xFCnk\xFC al\u0131\u015Fkanl\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 dinliyor.",
        "Hold your poise and posture as the person you are evolving to become.": "D\xF6n\xFC\u015Fmekte oldu\u011Fun ki\u015Fi gibi dengeni ve duru\u015Funu koru.",
        "Holding a lucid vision gives direction, but daily craftsmanship gives it physical form.": "Net bir vizyon y\xF6n verir; g\xFCnl\xFCk ustal\u0131k ona somut bi\xE7im kazand\u0131r\u0131r.",
        "Home Gym": "Ev Spor Salonu",
        "Home Library & Reading Room": "Ev K\xFCt\xFCphanesi ve Okuma Odas\u0131",
