        "Honesty": "D\xFCr\xFCstl\xFCk",
        "Honor The Vision": "Vizyona Sad\u0131k Kal",
        "Honor your daily standards with peaceful focus and quiet grace.": "G\xFCnl\xFCk standartlar\u0131n\u0131 huzurlu bir odak ve sessiz bir zarafetle s\xFCrd\xFCr.",
        "Horizons and retreats": "Ufuklar ve inzivalar",
