        "Hot Air Balloon at Dawn": "\u015Eafakta S\u0131cak Hava Balonu",
        "Hot Springs": "Kapl\u0131calar",
        "House on a hill above the Pacific with a deck that hangs over the treeline and a fog-and-sunlight rhythm.": "Pasifik'in \xFCzerinde bir tepede, a\u011Fa\xE7lar\u0131n \xF6tesine uzanan teras\u0131 ve sisle g\xFCne\u015Fin ritmiyle bir ev.",
        "How aligned and high-leverage is your daily enterprise?": "G\xFCnl\xFCk i\u015Flerin hedeflerinle ne kadar uyumlu ve etkili?",
        "How calm, orderly, and inspiring is your physical sanctuary?": "Fiziksel s\u0131\u011F\u0131na\u011F\u0131n ne kadar sakin, d\xFCzenli ve ilham verici?",
        "How clear and grounding is your reason for daily action?": "Her g\xFCn harekete ge\xE7me nedenin ne kadar net ve sa\u011Flam?",
        "How consistently are you mastering high-value skills?": "De\u011Ferli becerilerde ne kadar istikrarl\u0131 bi\xE7imde ustala\u015F\u0131yorsun?",
        "How often do you do what you said you would, without delay?": "Yapaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 s\xF6yledi\u011Fin \u015Feyi gecikmeden ne s\u0131kl\u0131kla yap\u0131yorsun?",
        "How present, honest, and generous are you with your closest people?": "En yak\u0131nlar\u0131na ne kadar dikkat, d\xFCr\xFCstl\xFCk ve c\xF6mertlik g\xF6steriyorsun?",
        "How resilient, well-rested, and energised is your physical body?": "Bedenin ne kadar dayan\u0131kl\u0131, dinlenmi\u015F ve enerjik?",
        "How secure, intentional, and autonomous does your capital feel?": "Sermayen sana ne kadar g\xFCvenli, bilin\xE7li ve ba\u011F\u0131ms\u0131z hissettiriyor?",
        "How will you generate this capital?": "Bu sermayeyi nas\u0131l olu\u015Fturacaks\u0131n?",
        "Hydrate with mineral water before morning caffeine": "Sabah kafeininden \xF6nce mineralli su i\xE7",
        "Hydrate, reflect, and reset.": "Su i\xE7, de\u011Ferlendir ve yenilen.",
        "Hydration & Nutrition": "Su ve Beslenme",
        "Hypercar": "Hiper Otomobil",
        "I act before I feel ready.": "Haz\u0131r hissetmeden harekete ge\xE7erim.",
        "I already reviewed it": "Zaten g\xF6zden ge\xE7irdim",
        "I am building a life of creative sovereignty, calm energy, and meaningful craftsmanship.": "Yarat\u0131c\u0131 \xF6zg\xFCrl\xFCk, sakin enerji ve anlaml\u0131 ustal\u0131kla dolu bir hayat in\u015Fa ediyorum.",
        "I am building a life where I do deep work with calm focus, achieve complete financial autonomy, and show up fully for the people I care about.": "Sakin bir odakla derin \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131\u011F\u0131m, tam finansal \xF6zg\xFCrl\xFC\u011Fe ula\u015Ft\u0131\u011F\u0131m ve sevdiklerimin yan\u0131nda b\xFCt\xFCn\xFCyle oldu\u011Fum bir hayat in\u015Fa ediyorum.",
        "I am building a life where...": "\xD6yle bir hayat in\u015Fa ediyorum ki...",
        "I am someone who finishes important work, protects my attention, and acts before I feel ready.": "\xD6nemli i\u015Fleri bitiren, dikkatini koruyan ve haz\u0131r hissetmeden harekete ge\xE7en biriyim.",
        'I just unlocked "{name}" in my simulation through daily completed missions on One Decision Away.': `One Decision Away'de her g\xFCn tamamlad\u0131\u011F\u0131m g\xF6revlerle sim\xFClasyonumda "{name}" kilidini a\xE7t\u0131m.`,
        "I refuse to become someone who leaves their best ideas in notes and lets distraction decide their life.": "En iyi fikirlerini notlarda b\u0131rakan ve hayat\u0131n\u0131 dikkat da\u011F\u0131t\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131n belirlemesine izin veren biri olmay\u0131 reddediyorum.",
        "I refuse to become someone who leaves their best potential in draft notes and lets distraction decide their fate.": "En y\xFCksek potansiyelini taslak notlarda b\u0131rakan ve kaderini dikkat da\u011F\u0131t\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131n belirlemesine izin veren biri olmay\u0131 reddediyorum.",
        "I refuse to become someone who...": "\u015E\xF6yle biri olmay\u0131 reddediyorum...",
