        "Image uploaded.": "G\xF6rsel y\xFCklendi.",
        "Imagine a door in front of you. On the other side is your life, three years from now, if you keep choosing well.": "\xD6n\xFCnde bir kap\u0131 hayal et. Di\u011Fer taraf\u0131nda, iyi se\xE7imler yapmay\u0131 s\xFCrd\xFCr\xFCrsen \xFC\xE7 y\u0131l sonra ya\u015Fayaca\u011F\u0131n hayat var.",
        "Imagine a road splitting in two. Take the left path first. This is the road where nothing changes.": "\u0130kiye ayr\u0131lan bir yol hayal et. \xD6nce soldan git. Hi\xE7bir \u015Feyin de\u011Fi\u015Fmedi\u011Fi yol bu.",
        "Imagine the feeling of finishing it. That quiet, deep satisfaction. That is real reward.": "Bitirdi\u011Findeki hissi hayal et. O sessiz, derin tatmini. Ger\xE7ek \xF6d\xFCl budur.",
        "Immutable Ledger Data": "De\u011Fi\u015Ftirilemez Hesap Verileri",
