        "Nothing found to archive.": "Ar\u015Fivlenecek bir \u015Fey bulunamad\u0131.",
        "Notice any restlessness in your body. The urge to check, to scroll, to reach for something. Just notice it.": "Bedenindeki huzursuzlu\u011Fu fark et. Kontrol etme, kayd\u0131rma, bir \u015Feye uzanma iste\u011Fini. Yaln\u0131zca fark et.",
        "Notice how they hold their shoulders. Their eyes. The pace of their words. Feel it in your own body now.": "Omuzlar\u0131n\u0131 nas\u0131l tuttuklar\u0131n\u0131 fark et. G\xF6zlerini. Konu\u015Fmalar\u0131n\u0131n h\u0131z\u0131n\u0131. \u015Eimdi bunu kendi bedeninde hisset.",
        "Notice the home you live in. Walk through it slowly. Touch the surfaces. Feel how it feels to be here.": "Ya\u015Fad\u0131\u011F\u0131n evi fark et. \u0130\xE7inde yava\u015F\xE7a y\xFCr\xFC. Y\xFCzeylere dokun. Burada olman\u0131n hissini duy.",
        "Notice where that doubt lives in your body. A tightness. A heaviness. Just locate it.": "Bu \u015F\xFCphenin bedeninde nerede ya\u015Fad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 fark et. Bir s\u0131k\u0131\u015Fma. Bir a\u011F\u0131rl\u0131k. Yaln\u0131zca yerini bul.",
        "Notice your body. How do you carry yourself? How do you move, breathe, stand?": "Bedenini fark et. Nas\u0131l bir duru\u015Fun var? Nas\u0131l hareket ediyor, nefes al\u0131yor, ayakta duruyorsun?",
        "Notice: nothing outside you changed. Only what you looked at. This is a superpower.": "Fark et: d\u0131\u015Far\u0131da hi\xE7bir \u015Fey de\u011Fi\u015Fmedi. Yaln\u0131zca bakt\u0131\u011F\u0131n \u015Fey de\u011Fi\u015Fti. Bu bir s\xFCper g\xFC\xE7.",
        "Notice: the urge is already softer. You are stronger than the pull.": "Fark et: d\xFCrt\xFC \u015Fimdiden yumu\u015Fad\u0131. Sen onun \xE7ekiminden g\xFC\xE7l\xFCs\xFCn.",
        "Noticed {n} resistance thoughts.": "{n} diren\xE7 d\xFC\u015F\xFCncesi fark edildi.",
        "Notification permission granted.": "Bildirim izni verildi.",
        "Notifications are blocked in the browser. Allow them to receive nudges.": "Taray\u0131c\u0131 bildirimleri engelliyor. Hat\u0131rlatmalar\u0131 almak i\xE7in izin ver.",
        "Now": "\u015Eimdi",
        "Now find your future self in this life. Look into their eyes. They are calm, clear, and proud of you.": "\u015Eimdi bu hayatta gelecekteki benli\u011Fini bul. G\xF6zlerine bak. Sakin, net ve seninle gurur duyuyor.",
        "Now it is three years. The projects you were going to start are still ideas. Notice what you stopped mentioning to people.": "\u015Eimdi \xFC\xE7 y\u0131l ge\xE7ti. Ba\u015Flayaca\u011F\u0131n projeler h\xE2l\xE2 fikir olarak duruyor. \u0130nsanlara art\u0131k nelerden s\xF6z etmedi\u011Fini fark et.",
        "Now name your one task. Only one. Say it silently, clearly, as a single sentence.": "\u015Eimdi tek i\u015Fini adland\u0131r. Yaln\u0131zca bir tane. \u0130\xE7inden, net\xE7e, tek bir c\xFCmleyle s\xF6yle.",
        "Now recognize: this is not truth. It is a story. Someone, or something, taught it to you.": "\u015Eimdi fark et: bu ger\xE7ek de\u011Fil. Bir hik\xE2ye. Biri veya bir \u015Fey sana bunu \xF6\u011Fretti.",
        "Now simply rest in this stillness. Nothing to fix. Nothing to chase. Just breathing.": "\u015Eimdi bu dinginlikte dinlen. D\xFCzeltecek bir \u015Fey yok. Pe\u015Finden ko\u015Facak bir \u015Fey yok. Yaln\u0131zca nefes.",
        "Now think of something small from today. A taste. A sound. A moment of comfort. Thank it.": "\u015Eimdi bug\xFCnden k\xFC\xE7\xFCk bir \u015Fey d\xFC\u015F\xFCn. Bir tat. Bir ses. Rahat hissetti\u011Fin bir an. Ona te\u015Fekk\xFCr et.",
        "Now turn around. Walk back to the fork. Feel each step getting lighter.": "\u015Eimdi d\xF6n. Yol ayr\u0131m\u0131na geri y\xFCr\xFC. Her ad\u0131m\u0131n\u0131n hafifledi\u011Fini hisset.",
        "Now, from this place, look back at today. What is the one decision that moved you onto this road?": "\u015Eimdi buradan bug\xFCne bak. Seni bu yola ta\u015F\u0131yan tek karar neydi?",
        "Now, why are you doing this? Not the small reason. The real one. Who are you becoming? Who are you doing it for?": "Peki bunu neden yap\u0131yorsun? K\xFC\xE7\xFCk nedeni de\u011Fil. Ger\xE7ek olan\u0131. Kime d\xF6n\xFC\u015F\xFCyorsun? Kimin i\xE7in yap\u0131yorsun?",
