        "Savings progress update": "Birikim ilerleme g\xFCncellemesi",
        "Say no to one low-value impulse today to protect your deep work hours.": "Derin \xE7al\u0131\u015Fma saatlerini korumak i\xE7in bug\xFCn d\xFC\u015F\xFCk de\u011Ferli bir d\xFCrt\xFCye hay\u0131r de.",
        "Say no to one thing this afternoon so you can say yes to the thing that matters.": "\xD6nemli olana evet diyebilmek i\xE7in bu \xF6\u011Fleden sonra bir \u015Feye hay\u0131r de.",
        "Say silently: For the next session, this is the only thing that exists.": "\u0130\xE7inden s\xF6yle: \xD6n\xFCm\xFCzdeki oturum boyunca var olan tek \u015Fey bu.",
        "Say silently: I am allowed to feel good today. I do not have to earn it. It is already mine.": "\u0130\xE7inden s\xF6yle: Bug\xFCn iyi hissetmeme izin var. Bunu hak etmek i\xE7in u\u011Fra\u015Fmak zorunda de\u011Filim. Zaten benim.",
        "Say silently: I am becoming this person, one decision at a time.": "\u0130\xE7inden s\xF6yle: Her kararla bu ki\u015Fiye d\xF6n\xFC\u015F\xFCyorum.",
        "Say silently: I did enough today. I am allowed to stop now.": "\u0130\xE7inden s\xF6yle: Bug\xFCn yeterince yapt\u0131m. Art\u0131k durabilirim.",
        "Say silently: I do not need permission. I do not need approval. I am already enough.": "\u0130\xE7inden s\xF6yle: \u0130zne ihtiyac\u0131m yok. Onaya ihtiyac\u0131m yok. Zaten yeterliyim.",
        "Say silently: I do not wait to feel ready. I act, and readiness follows.": "\u0130\xE7inden s\xF6yle: Haz\u0131r hissetmeyi beklemiyorum. Harekete ge\xE7iyorum, haz\u0131r olma hali ard\u0131ndan geliyor.",
        "Say silently: I have enough. I am enough. And more is on its way.": "\u0130\xE7inden s\xF6yle: Yeterince \u015Feye sahibim. Ben yeterliyim. Ve daha fazlas\u0131 yolda.",
        "Say silently: I have proof. I have done hard things before. I will do them again.": "\u0130\xE7inden s\xF6yle: Kan\u0131t\u0131m var. Daha \xF6nce zor \u015Feyler yapt\u0131m. Yine yapaca\u011F\u0131m.",
        "Say silently: I see you. I understand how I got here. And I refuse to stay.": "\u0130\xE7inden s\xF6yle: Seni g\xF6r\xFCyorum. Buraya nas\u0131l geldi\u011Fimi anl\u0131yorum. Ve burada kalmay\u0131 reddediyorum.",
        "Say silently: I speak clearly. I decide quickly. I keep my standards, even when no one is watching.": "\u0130\xE7inden s\xF6yle: A\xE7\u0131k konu\u015Furum. H\u0131zl\u0131 karar veririm. Kimse g\xF6rmese de standartlar\u0131m\u0131 korurum.",
        "Say silently: I trust myself. I keep my word to myself. What I decide, I do.": "\u0130\xE7inden s\xF6yle: Kendime g\xFCveniyorum. Kendime verdi\u011Fim s\xF6z\xFC tutuyorum. Karar verdi\u011Fimi yap\u0131yorum.",
        "Say silently: Today I move. Today I build. Today is one decision away from a different life.": "\u0130\xE7inden s\xF6yle: Bug\xFCn harekete ge\xE7iyorum. Bug\xFCn in\u015Fa ediyorum. Bug\xFCn farkl\u0131 bir hayata bir karar uzaktay\u0131m.",
        "Saying no to frantic projects, rush hours, and misaligned requests.": "Tela\u015Fl\u0131 projelere, yo\u011Fun saatlere ve sana uymayan isteklere hay\u0131r demek.",
