        "Seven days of guided physical conditioning, biomarker diagnostics, thermal mineral baths, and circadian reset in the Swiss Alps.": "\u0130svi\xE7re Alpleri'nde yedi g\xFCn rehberli fiziksel kondisyon, biyobelirte\xE7 analizi, termal mineral banyolar\u0131 ve sirkadiyen ritmi yeniden d\xFCzenleme.",
        "Seven mornings in the water with a coach, sunset sessions, and a body that feels ten years younger.": "Bir e\u011Fitmenle suda yedi sabah, g\xFCn bat\u0131m\u0131 seanslar\u0131 ve kendini on ya\u015F gen\xE7 hisseden bir beden.",
