        "Silent, sound-only sessions. Refresh the mind, shake off tension, or tune in before deep work.": "Konu\u015Fmas\u0131z, yaln\u0131zca sesli oturumlar. Zihnini tazele, gerginli\u011Fi b\u0131rak veya derin \xE7al\u0131\u015Fma \xF6ncesinde haz\u0131rlan.",
        "Silver": "G\xFCm\xFC\u015F",
        "Silver 1960s Mercedes roadster \u2014 elegance from an era when cars were sculpted.": "1960'lardan g\xFCm\xFC\u015F Mercedes roadster \u2014 otomobillerin adeta yontuldu\u011Fu bir \xE7a\u011F\u0131n zarafeti.",
        "Silver and gold chronograph at ten past ten \u2014 the classic dress-sport balance.": "Saat onu on ge\xE7eyi g\xF6steren g\xFCm\xFC\u015F ve alt\u0131n kronograf \u2014 klasik \u015F\u0131kl\u0131k ve spor dengesi.",
