        "Singapore Sky Garden Penthouse": "Singapore G\xF6ky\xFCz\xFC Bah\xE7eli \xC7at\u0131 Dairesi",
        "Singing bowls and temple gong tones anchor the mind firmly in the present moment.": "Ses kaseleri ve tap\u0131nak gonglar\u0131n\u0131n tonlar\u0131 zihni \u015Fimdiki ana sa\u011Flamca ba\u011Flar.",
        "Single Story": "Tek Katl\u0131",
        "Single-story modernist villa where every room opens onto a mirror-still pool and Mediterranean garden.": "Her odas\u0131 ayna gibi durgun bir havuza ve Akdeniz bah\xE7esine a\xE7\u0131lan tek katl\u0131 modernist villa.",
        "Single-tasking": "Tek i\u015Fe odaklanma",
        "Sit as if you are already the person you are becoming. Notice how the posture changes on its own.": "D\xF6n\xFC\u015Fmekte oldu\u011Fun ki\u015Fi zaten senmi\u015Fsin gibi otur. Duru\u015Funun kendili\u011Finden nas\u0131l de\u011Fi\u015Fti\u011Fini fark et.",
        "Sit at your workspace. Close your eyes. In six minutes you will begin the most important work of your day.": "\xC7al\u0131\u015Fma alan\u0131na otur. G\xF6zlerini kapat. Alt\u0131 dakika sonra g\xFCn\xFCn\xFCn en \xF6nemli i\u015Fine ba\u015Flayacaks\u0131n.",
        "Sit comfortably and close your eyes. In this session, you will visit the life you are building.": "Rahat\xE7a otur ve g\xF6zlerini kapat. Bu oturumda in\u015Fa etti\u011Fin hayat\u0131 ziyaret edeceksin.",
        "Sit down and close your eyes. This walk has two halves. The first one is not comfortable, and that is the point.": "Otur ve g\xF6zlerini kapat. Bu y\xFCr\xFCy\xFC\u015F\xFCn iki yar\u0131s\u0131 var. \u0130lki rahat de\u011Fil; zaten ama\xE7 da bu.",
        "Sit up straight. Spine tall. Chin level. This session is not for resting. It is for igniting.": "Dik otur. Omurgan uzas\u0131n. \xC7enen yere paralel olsun. Bu oturum dinlenmek i\xE7in de\u011Fil. \u0130\xE7indeki ate\u015Fi yakmak i\xE7in.",
        "Sit with the stillness. Let your baseline come back up. You are recalibrating.": "Dinginli\u011Fin i\xE7inde kal. Do\u011Fal seviyen yeniden y\xFCkselsin. Kendini yeniden ayarl\u0131yorsun.",
        "Six Seats": "Alt\u0131 Koltuk",
        "Six full months of living expenses untouched in liquid reserves, giving complete autonomy over career choices.": "Kariyer se\xE7imlerinde tam ba\u011F\u0131ms\u0131zl\u0131k sa\u011Flayan, likit rezervlerde dokunulmadan duran alt\u0131 ayl\u0131k ya\u015Fam gideri.",
        "Sixty seconds of freefall from 4,000 m \u2014 fear, then the widest view of your life.": "4.000 metreden altm\u0131\u015F saniye serbest d\xFC\u015F\xFC\u015F \u2014 \xF6nce korku, sonra hayat\u0131n\u0131n en geni\u015F manzaras\u0131.",
        "Skeletonized Calibre 3132": "\u0130skeletle\u015Ftirilmi\u015F Kalibre 3132",
