        "Ski-in chalet in old larch with a slate spa, fireplace lounge and a boot room that smells of pine.": "Eski kara\xE7amdan yap\u0131lm\u0131\u015F; arduvaz spas\u0131, \u015F\xF6mineli salonu ve \xE7am kokan bot odas\u0131yla kayakla girilen da\u011F evi.",
