        "Take Snapshot": "Anl\u0131k G\xF6r\xFCnt\xFC Al",
        "Take Your Own Photo": "Kendi Foto\u011Fraf\u0131n\u0131 \xC7ek",
        "Take a boat-handling course and rent one for a weekend.": "Tekne kullan\u0131m kursuna kat\u0131l ve bir hafta sonu i\xE7in tekne kirala.",
        "Take a deep breath. Open your eyes. Now write down the one decision your future self gave you.": "Derin bir nefes al. G\xF6zlerini a\xE7. \u015Eimdi gelecekteki halinin sana verdi\u011Fi tek karar\u0131 yaz.",
        "Take a deep, grateful breath. Hold the feeling.": "Derin ve \u015F\xFCkran dolu bir nefes al. Bu hissi koru.",
        "Take a full breath. When you open your eyes, choose one real action instead of one more scroll.": "Dolu bir nefes al. G\xF6zlerini a\xE7t\u0131\u011F\u0131nda bir kez daha ekran\u0131 kayd\u0131rmak yerine ger\xE7ek bir eylem se\xE7.",
        "Take a photo from your camera and jot down your mental state, execution win, or vision reflection.": "Kameranla bir foto\u011Fraf \xE7ek ve ruh halini, eylem ba\u015Far\u0131n\u0131 veya vizyonuna dair d\xFC\u015F\xFCnceni not et.",
        "Take a slow breath in through your nose... and let it out through your mouth, like a long sigh.": "Burnundan yava\u015F\xE7a nefes al... ve uzun bir i\xE7 \xE7eki\u015F gibi a\u011Fz\u0131ndan b\u0131rak.",
        "Take a two-week Paris stay in the 7th and test the daily rhythm.": "Paris'in 7. b\xF6lgesinde iki hafta kal ve g\xFCnl\xFCk ritmi dene.",
        "Take one concrete physical step toward this milestone before the day concludes.": "G\xFCn bitmeden bu d\xF6n\xFCm noktas\u0131na do\u011Fru somut bir fiziksel ad\u0131m at.",
        "Take one deep breath. Open your eyes. Go set it, and go do it.": "Derin bir nefes al. G\xF6zlerini a\xE7. Git, karar\u0131n\u0131 belirle ve uygula.",
        "Take one deep, grateful breath. Let it out with a smile.": "Derin ve \u015F\xFCkran dolu bir nefes al. G\xFCl\xFCmseyerek b\u0131rak.",
        "Take one deeper breath. When you are ready, gently open your eyes, carrying this calm with you.": "Biraz daha derin nefes al. Haz\u0131r oldu\u011Funda g\xF6zlerini nazik\xE7e a\xE7 ve bu sakinli\u011Fi yan\u0131nda ta\u015F\u0131.",
        "Take one strong breath in. Let it out slowly.": "G\xFC\xE7l\xFC bir nefes al. Yava\u015F\xE7a b\u0131rak.",
        "Take photo": "Foto\u011Fraf \xE7ek",
        "Take the Lofoten road trip and shortlist a village.": "Lofoten yolculu\u011Funa \xE7\u0131k ve bir k\xF6y se\xE7.",
        "Take the first 2-minute step on what you have been overthinking.": "Fazla d\xFC\u015F\xFCnd\xFC\u011F\xFCn konuda ilk 2 dakikal\u0131k ad\u0131m\u0131 at.",
        "Take the right path. This is the road where you kept your word to yourself.": "Sa\u011Fdaki yolu se\xE7. Bu, kendine verdi\u011Fin s\xF6z\xFC tuttu\u011Fun yol.",
        "Take the train \u2014 no car needed.": "Trene bin \u2014 arabaya gerek yok.",
        "Take three sharp breaths in through the nose, and out through the mouth. Wake the body up.": "Burundan al\u0131p a\u011F\u0131zdan vererek \xFC\xE7 canl\u0131 nefes al. Bedeni uyand\u0131r.",
        "Talk to a yacht broker about fractional and charter income.": "Bir yat arac\u0131s\u0131yla ortak m\xFClkiyet ve kiralama gelirleri hakk\u0131nda konu\u015F.",
        "Tandem Skydive": "Tandem Para\u015F\xFCt Atlay\u0131\u015F\u0131",
        "Tanzania": "Tanzania",
        "Tap Chime": "Dokunu\u015F \xC7an\u0131",
        "Tap any habit below to mark it done for today.": "Bug\xFCn tamamland\u0131 olarak i\u015Faretlemek i\xE7in a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131daki al\u0131\u015Fkanl\u0131klardan birine dokun.",
        "Tap the moment you catch yourself sliding. Each tap is one honest vote for the default future \u2014 and noticing it is the first vote back.": "Kendini kayarken fark etti\u011Fin anda dokun. Her dokunu\u015F Ak\u0131\u015F\u0131na B\u0131rak\u0131lan Gelece\u011Fe verilmi\u015F d\xFCr\xFCst bir oy \u2014 ve bunu fark etmek geri d\xF6n\xFC\u015F\xFCn ilk oyu.",
