        "Tax-efficient global base with sunshine, ambition and a runway for business.": "G\xFCne\u015F, iddia ve i\u015F kurmak i\xE7in alan sunan, vergi a\xE7\u0131s\u0131ndan verimli k\xFCresel \xFCs.",
