        "Today's Signature Decision": "Bug\xFCn\xFCn \u0130mza Karar\u0131",
        "Today's lines": "Bug\xFCn\xFCn sat\u0131rlar\u0131",
        "Today's signature decision was successfully executed and recorded in your ledger (+D$ 500).": "Bug\xFCn\xFCn imza karar\u0131 ba\u015Far\u0131yla hayata ge\xE7irildi ve hesap defterine kaydedildi (+D$ 500).",
        "Today: {title}": "Bug\xFCn: {title}",
        "Today\u2019s One Decision Completed": "Bug\xFCn\xFCn Tek Karar\u0131 Tamamland\u0131",
        "Today\u2019s One Decision is locked in. Complete it to earn D$500!": "Bug\xFCn\xFCn Tek Karar\u0131 belirlendi. Tamamla ve D$500 kazan!",
        "Toggle Browser Tab Title Blink Animation": "Taray\u0131c\u0131 Sekme Ba\u015Fl\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131n Yan\u0131p S\xF6nmesini A\xE7/Kapat",
