        "Total currency gained": "Kazan\u0131lan toplam para",
        "Total disconnection, total renewal.": "Tamamen uzakla\u015F, tamamen yenilen.",
        "Total lifetime executions": "Bug\xFCne kadar tamamlanan toplam eylem",
        "Total maritime freedom across the Mediterranean and coastal waters.": "Akdeniz ve k\u0131y\u0131 sular\u0131nda s\u0131n\u0131rs\u0131z deniz \xF6zg\xFCrl\xFC\u011F\xFC.",
        "Total maritime freedom, swimming in crystal waters at dawn, and unhurried luxury.": "Denizde s\u0131n\u0131rs\u0131z \xF6zg\xFCrl\xFCk, \u015Fafakta berrak sularda y\xFCzmek ve aceleye gelmeyen l\xFCks.",
        "Tour Aegean islands and engage Greek notary for property verification.": "Ege adalar\u0131n\u0131 gez ve m\xFClk do\u011Frulamas\u0131 i\xE7in Yunanistan'da bir noterle \xE7al\u0131\u015F.",
        "Tour three downtown lofts and build a NYC cost-of-living model.": "\u015Eehir merkezinde \xFC\xE7 loft gez ve New York i\xE7in bir ya\u015Fam maliyeti modeli olu\u015Ftur.",
        "Toward built future": "\u0130n\u015Fa etti\u011Fin gelece\u011Fe do\u011Fru",
        "Track Goal:": "Hedef Takibi:",
        "Track This Direction Every Day in Life OS": "Bu Y\xF6n\xFC Her G\xFCn Ya\u015Fam OS'te Takip Et",
        "Track the market on three 458s for six months.": "Alt\u0131 ay boyunca \xFC\xE7 458'in piyasa fiyat\u0131n\u0131 takip et.",
        "Tracked Routines:": "Takip Edilen Rutinler:",
        "Tracking commitment frequency and accomplishment status of your single daily focus over the past 30 days.": "Son 30 g\xFCn boyunca g\xFCnl\xFCk tek oda\u011F\u0131na ne s\u0131kl\u0131kla ba\u011Fl\u0131 kald\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 ve onu tamamlay\u0131p tamamlamad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 takip eder.",
        "Trackside Yacht Mooring": "Pist Yan\u0131nda Yat Ba\u011Flama Yeri",
        "Traditional house with a moss garden, stone lantern path, engawa veranda and a tea room facing the maples.": "Yosun bah\xE7esi, ta\u015F fenerli yolu, engawa verandas\u0131 ve ak\xE7aa\u011Fa\xE7lara bakan \xE7ay odas\u0131yla geleneksel ev.",
        "Train Access": "Tren Ula\u015F\u0131m\u0131",
        "Trajectory Momentum": "Gidi\u015Fat \u0130vmesi",
        "Trajectory: {status}": "Gidi\u015Fat: {status}",
        "Translate symbolic Future Life dreams into concrete savings timelines and real-world actions.": "Gelecekteki Hayat\u0131na ait sembolik hayalleri somut birikim takvimlerine ve ger\xE7ek ad\u0131mlara d\xF6n\xFC\u015Ft\xFCr.",
        "Translating symbolic Dream Market purchases into physical savings accounts and actions.": "Hayal Pazar\u0131'ndaki sembolik al\u0131\u015Fveri\u015Fleri ger\xE7ek birikim hesaplar\u0131na ve eylemlere d\xF6n\xFC\u015Ft\xFCr\xFCr.",
        "Travel": "Seyahat",
