        "Waiting for ideal conditions is subtle procrastination. Excellence thrives within constraints.": "\u0130deal ko\u015Fullar\u0131 beklemek, gizli bir erteleme bi\xE7imidir. M\xFCkemmellik k\u0131s\u0131tlar i\xE7inde geli\u015Fir.",
