        "You haven't answered the eight \"life you're allowing\" questions yet.": '"\u0130zin verdi\u011Fin hayat" hakk\u0131ndaki sekiz soruyu hen\xFCz yan\u0131tlamad\u0131n.',
        "You haven't set today's One Decision yet.": "Bug\xFCn\xFCn Tek Karar\u0131n\u0131 hen\xFCz belirlemedin.",
