        "You're one decision away. Not someday \u2014 today.": "Bir karar uzaktas\u0131n. Bir g\xFCn de\u011Fil \u2014 bug\xFCn.",
        "You've reached today's 5 paid daily quests. Mission completed and recorded toward your Future Life!": "Bug\xFCn\xFCn 5 \xF6d\xFCll\xFC g\xFCnl\xFCk g\xF6revine ula\u015Ft\u0131n. G\xF6rev tamamland\u0131 ve Gelecekteki Hayat\u0131na kaydedildi!",
        "Your Custom Categories": "\xD6zel Kategorilerin",
        "Your First Concrete Real-World Step": "Ger\xE7ek D\xFCnyadaki \u0130lk Somut Ad\u0131m\u0131n",
        "Your Future Life Gallery is Empty": "Gelecekteki Hayat Galerin Bo\u015F",
        "Your Future Life Score is {score}/100. Your current actions are not yet supporting the future you described. That is information, not a verdict \u2014 and it is exactly what this app is for.": "Gelecekteki Hayat Puan\u0131n {score}/100. Mevcut eylemlerin, tarif etti\u011Fin gelece\u011Fi hen\xFCz desteklemiyor. Bu bir bilgi, h\xFCk\xFCm de\u011Fil \u2014 ve bu uygulama tam da bunun i\xE7in var.",
        "Your Future Self ({futureRole}) has already overcome today's micro-resistances.": "Gelecekteki Benli\u011Fin ({futureRole}), bug\xFCn\xFCn k\xFC\xE7\xFCk diren\xE7lerini \xE7oktan a\u015Ft\u0131.",
        "Your Two Futures Compass": "\u0130ki Gelecek Pusulan",
        "Your Vision Board Is Empty": "Vizyon Panon Bo\u015F",
        "Your anchor execution pillar. Pair developing routines directly after these habits for seamless habit stacking.": "Temel eylem dayana\u011F\u0131n. Al\u0131\u015Fkanl\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 kolayca birbirine ba\u011Flamak i\xE7in geli\u015Ftirmek istedi\u011Fin rutinleri bu al\u0131\u015Fkanl\u0131klar\u0131n hemen arkas\u0131na ekle.",
        "Your brain has been trained to expect a reward every few seconds. Right now, you are retraining it.": "Beynin birka\xE7 saniyede bir \xF6d\xFCl beklemeye al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131. \u015Eu anda onu yeniden e\u011Fitiyorsun.",
        "Your breath is slow and deep, like waves rolling onto a quiet shore.": "Nefesin, sakin bir k\u0131y\u0131ya vuran dalgalar gibi yava\u015F ve derin.",
        "Your chest rises and falls on its own. Each exhale lets the body sink a little deeper.": "G\xF6\u011Fs\xFCn kendi kendine y\xFCkselip al\xE7al\u0131yor. Her nefes veri\u015Fte bedenin biraz daha gev\u015Fiyor.",
        "Your current actions are largely supporting the future you want. The work now is protecting what works.": "Mevcut eylemlerin, istedi\u011Fin gelece\u011Fi b\xFCy\xFCk \xF6l\xE7\xFCde destekliyor. \u015Eimdi g\xF6rev, i\u015Fe yarayanlar\u0131 korumak.",
        "Your data lives only in this browser.": "Verilerin yaln\u0131zca bu taray\u0131c\u0131da saklan\u0131r.",
        "Your dominant internal monologue sculpts your physical perception and choices.": "Bask\u0131n i\xE7 sesin, d\xFCnyay\u0131 alg\u0131lay\u0131\u015F\u0131n\u0131 ve se\xE7imlerini \u015Fekillendirir.",
        "Your emotional anchor and future-self standard.": "Duygusal dayana\u011F\u0131n ve gelecekteki benlik standard\u0131n.",
        "Your external life is a trailing indicator of your internal standards and beliefs.": "D\u0131\u015F d\xFCnyadaki hayat\u0131n, i\xE7sel standartlar\u0131n\u0131n ve inan\xE7lar\u0131n\u0131n gecikmeli bir g\xF6stergesidir.",
        "Your future is not decided by grand once-a-year resolutions, but by the private standards you uphold when nobody is watching.": "Gelece\u011Fini y\u0131lda bir al\u0131nan b\xFCy\xFCk kararlar de\u011Fil, kimse bakm\u0131yorken korudu\u011Fun ki\u015Fisel standartlar belirler.",
        "Your future is not forged in occasional marathons\u2014it is constructed by making and executing exactly": "Gelece\u011Fin, ara s\u0131ra ko\u015Fulan maratonlarla de\u011Fil, her g\xFCn kararl\u0131 ad\u0131mlar atarak in\u015Fa edilir:",
        "Your future self is already awake. Give them one thing to be proud of by tonight.": "Gelecekteki benli\u011Fin \xE7oktan uyand\u0131. Bu ak\u015Fama kadar ona gurur duyaca\u011F\u0131 bir \u015Fey ver.",
        "Your future self is watching this exact moment. Every hour you waste, they lose. Every hour you invest, they win.": "Gelecekteki benli\u011Fin tam \u015Fu an\u0131 izliyor. Bo\u015Fa harcad\u0131\u011F\u0131n her saatte o kaybediyor. Yat\u0131r\u0131m yapt\u0131\u011F\u0131n her saatte o kazan\u0131yor.",
        "Your highest output area currently.": "\u015Eu anda en \xE7ok \xFCretti\u011Fin alan.",
        "Your highest-momentum life domain this week is": "Bu hafta en \xE7ok ivme kazand\u0131\u011F\u0131n ya\u015Fam alan\u0131",
        "Your immutable ledger of symbolic earnings, marketplace expenditures, and savings momentum.": "Sembolik kazan\xE7lar\u0131n\u0131n, pazar harcamalar\u0131n\u0131n ve birikim ivmenin de\u011Fi\u015Ftirilemez hesap defteri.",
        "Your legs are heavy. Your feet are warm. The whole body is sinking, safe and supported.": "Bacaklar\u0131n a\u011F\u0131r. Ayaklar\u0131n s\u0131cak. T\xFCm bedenin gev\u015Fiyor, g\xFCvende ve desteklenmi\u015F hissediyor.",
        "Your life data, journal reflections, Dream Bank ledger, and Two Futures statements are stored locally on your device. Export a complete JSON backup at any time.": "Ya\u015Fam verilerin, g\xFCnl\xFCk yaz\u0131lar\u0131n, Hayal Bankas\u0131 hesap defterin ve \u0130ki Gelecek ifadelerin cihaz\u0131nda yerel olarak saklan\u0131r. \u0130stedi\u011Fin zaman tam bir JSON yede\u011Fi d\u0131\u015Fa aktar.",
        "Your past does not define your trajectory. Today's decisions rewrite your identity.": "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin gidi\u015Fat\u0131n\u0131 belirlemez. Bug\xFCnk\xFC kararlar\u0131n kimli\u011Fini yeniden yazar.",
        "Your priorities and personal vision have matured beyond this specific item.": "\xD6nceliklerin ve ki\u015Fisel vizyonun bu \xF6\u011Fenin \xF6tesine ge\xE7ti.",
        "Your shoulders melt into the surface beneath you. Your arms are heavy. Your hands are warm.": "Omuzlar\u0131n alt\u0131ndaki y\xFCzeye b\u0131rak\u0131yor kendini. Kollar\u0131n a\u011F\u0131r. Ellerin s\u0131cak.",
        "Your streak doesn't care how you feel. It cares what you do next.": "Serin nas\u0131l hissetti\u011Fine bakmaz. S\u0131radaki ad\u0131m\u0131na bakar.",
        "Your time is limited, so don't waste it living someone else's life.": "Zaman\u0131n s\u0131n\u0131rl\u0131, bu y\xFCzden onu ba\u015Fkas\u0131n\u0131n hayat\u0131n\u0131 ya\u015Fayarak harcama.",
        "Your vision is now drafted. Continue into Life OS to set your daily One Decision, earn Dream Dollars, and build your future world step by step.": "Vizyonunun tasla\u011F\u0131 haz\u0131r. G\xFCnl\xFCk Tek Karar\u0131n\u0131 belirlemek, Hayal Dolar\u0131 kazanmak ve gelecekteki d\xFCnyan\u0131 ad\u0131m ad\u0131m kurmak i\xE7in Ya\u015Fam OS'e ge\xE7.",
        "Your voice, published weekly.": "Sesin, her hafta yay\u0131nda.",
        "Your whole life OS lives in this browser. Download a backup regularly, and sign in to sync it across your phone and laptop.": "T\xFCm ya\u015Fam sistemin bu taray\u0131c\u0131da saklan\u0131r. D\xFCzenli olarak yedek indir; telefonunla bilgisayar\u0131n aras\u0131nda e\u015Fitlemek i\xE7in giri\u015F yap.",
        "Your willpower, decision stamina, and creative audacity are direct outputs of deep sleep, clean cellular hydration, and circadian alignment.": "\u0130raden, karar verme dayan\u0131kl\u0131l\u0131\u011F\u0131n ve yarat\u0131c\u0131 cesaretin; derin uykunun, yeterli su t\xFCketiminin ve biyolojik ritimle uyumun do\u011Frudan sonucudur.",
