        "Most active": "En aktif",
        "{area} ({n})": "{area} ({n})",
        "Needs attention": "\u0130lgi istiyor",
        "${n}/month": "${n}/ay",
        "No bridges yet. Buy a dream to set up a savings plan.": "Hen\xFCz k\xF6pr\xFC yok. Birikim plan\u0131 kurmak i\xE7in bir hayal sat\u0131n al.",
        "Export": "D\u0131\u015Fa aktar",
        "Habits CSV": "Al\u0131\u015Fkanl\u0131klar CSV",
        "A Tuesday in five years": "Be\u015F y\u0131l sonra bir sal\u0131",
        "If nothing changes, describe an ordinary Tuesday five years from now, from waking up to lights out.": "Hi\xE7bir \u015Fey de\u011Fi\u015Fmezse, be\u015F y\u0131l sonra s\u0131radan bir sal\u0131y\u0131 anlat; uyan\u0131\u015Ftan \u0131\u015F\u0131klar\u0131n kapanmas\u0131na kadar.",
        "Closed doors in ten years": "On y\u0131lda kapanan kap\u0131lar",
        "Ten years on this path, which doors have quietly closed for good?": "Bu yolda on y\u0131l sonra hangi kap\u0131lar sessizce ve kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak kapand\u0131?",
        "Late regret": "Ge\xE7 pi\u015Fmanl\u0131k",
        "What fear, discomfort or judgment are your avoidance habits protecting you from?": "Ka\xE7\u0131nma al\u0131\u015Fkanl\u0131klar\u0131n seni hangi korkudan, rahats\u0131zl\u0131ktan ya da yarg\u0131dan koruyor?",
        "What is that protection actually costing you in time, dignity and potential?": "Bu koruma sana zaman, onur ve potansiyel olarak ger\xE7ekte neye mal oluyor?",
        "Reputation": "\u0130tibar",
        "What does financial autonomy let you say no to?": "Finansal \xF6zg\xFCrl\xFCk neye hay\u0131r demeni sa\u011Flar?",
        "What I am building": "Kurdu\u011Fum \u015Fey",
        "My two futures": "\u0130ki gelece\u011Fim",
        "My vision: {vision}": "Vizyonum: {vision}",
        "Discipline does not come from willpower. It comes from looking at the cost of changing nothing, and naming the life you want instead.": "Disiplin irade g\xFCc\xFCnden gelmez. Hi\xE7bir \u015Feyi de\u011Fi\u015Ftirmemenin bedeline bakmaktan ve yerine istedi\u011Fin hayat\u0131 adland\u0131rmaktan gelir.",
        "Part 1. If nothing changes": "B\xF6l\xFCm 1. Hi\xE7bir \u015Fey de\u011Fi\u015Fmezse",
        "Eight questions. About five minutes.": "Sekiz soru. Yakla\u015F\u0131k be\u015F dakika.",
        "Part 2. What you are building": "B\xF6l\xFCm 2. Kurdu\u011Fun \u015Fey",
        "Four questions. Then two sentences.": "D\xF6rt soru. Sonra iki c\xFCmle.",
        "Be honest. Nobody sees these answers unless you share your card.": "D\xFCr\xFCst ol. Kart\u0131n\u0131 payla\u015Fmad\u0131k\xE7a bu cevaplar\u0131 kimse g\xF6rmez.",
        "Write here": "Buraya yaz",
        "What you are building": "Kurdu\u011Fun \u015Fey",
        "Be specific. Details, rhythms, boundaries.": "Somut ol. Ayr\u0131nt\u0131lar, ritimler, s\u0131n\u0131rlar.",
        "Two sentences": "\u0130ki c\xFCmle",
        "Condense your answers into two clear statements.": "Cevaplar\u0131n\u0131 iki net ifadeye indir.",
        "Make card": "Kart olu\u015Ftur",
        "Your card": "Kart\u0131n",
        "Save or share it. Your answers stay on your device.": "Kaydet ya da payla\u015F. Cevaplar\u0131n cihaz\u0131nda kal\u0131r.",
        'Include the "if nothing changes" line': '"Hi\xE7bir \u015Fey de\u011Fi\u015Fmezse" sat\u0131r\u0131n\u0131 ekle',
        "Download": "\u0130ndir",
        "Save this and continue into the app to set your one decision for today.": "Bunu kaydet ve bug\xFCn\xFCn tek karar\u0131n\u0131 belirlemek i\xE7in uygulamaya devam et.",
        "Save and continue": "Kaydet ve devam et",
        "Thirty days on one theme.": "Tek bir temada otuz g\xFCn.",
        "Joined": "Kat\u0131ld\u0131n",
        "Join": "Kat\u0131l",
        "Finish the season to earn the {name} badge on your profile.": "Profilinde {name} rozetini kazanmak i\xE7in sezonu bitir.",
        "No streak penalties. No artificial urgency.": "Seri cezas\u0131 yok. Yapay aciliyet yok.",
        "Sounds are muted. Turn them on to test.": "Sesler kapal\u0131. Denemek i\xE7in a\xE7.",
        "Played tap sound.": "Dokunma sesi \xE7al\u0131nd\u0131.",
        "Played completion sound.": "Tamamlama sesi \xE7al\u0131nd\u0131.",
        "Played {category} habit cue.": "{category} al\u0131\u015Fkanl\u0131k sesi \xE7al\u0131nd\u0131.",
        "Daily wisdom: {theme}": "G\xFCn\xFCn bilgeli\u011Fi: {theme}",
        "Daily wisdom preview sent for {time}.": "{time} i\xE7in g\xFCn\xFCn bilgeli\u011Fi \xF6nizlemesi g\xF6nderildi.",
        "Profile": "Profil",
        "Email": "E-posta",
        "Used across the whole app, including nudges and meditations.": "Hat\u0131rlatmalar ve meditasyonlar dahil t\xFCm uygulamada kullan\u0131l\u0131r.",
