        "Data": "Veri",
        "Everything is stored on this device. Export a full JSON copy any time.": "Her \u015Fey bu cihazda saklan\u0131r. \u0130stedi\u011Fin zaman tam bir JSON kopyas\u0131 d\u0131\u015Fa aktar.",
        "Export data": "Verileri d\u0131\u015Fa aktar",
        "Reset all data": "T\xFCm verileri s\u0131f\u0131rla",
        "Dream Dollars (D$) are a simulation. They have no monetary value and cannot be exchanged or withdrawn.": "Hayal Dolar\u0131 (D$) bir sim\xFClasyondur. Parasal de\u011Feri yoktur; takas edilemez, \xE7ekilemez.",
        "Dream purchases are visual anchors. Real acquisition happens through your own action, as modelled in the Reality bridge.": "Hayal sat\u0131n al\u0131mlar\u0131 g\xF6rsel \xE7apalard\u0131r. Ger\xE7ek edinim, Ger\xE7eklik k\xF6pr\xFCs\xFCnde modellendi\u011Fi gibi senin kendi eylemlerinle olur.",
        "Built by AurelyStudio. Your answers and reflections are never sold or shared.": "Designed by Yahya. Cevaplar\u0131n ve d\xFC\u015F\xFCncelerin asla sat\u0131lmaz ya da payla\u015F\u0131lmaz.",
        "Scheduled for {time}": "{time} i\xE7in planland\u0131",
        "Today's action": "Bug\xFCn\xFCn eylemi",
        "Download a full JSON copy of your data": "Verilerinin tam JSON kopyas\u0131n\u0131 indir",
        "Includes your notebook, journal, ledger ({n} entries), missions, habits, check-ins, dreams and preferences.": "Defterin, g\xFCnl\xFC\u011F\xFCn, hesap defterin ({n} kay\u0131t), g\xF6revlerin, al\u0131\u015Fkanl\u0131klar\u0131n, kontrollerin, hayallerin ve tercihlerin dahil.",
        "The file is created in your browser and saved straight to your device. Nothing is uploaded.": "Dosya taray\u0131c\u0131nda olu\u015Fturulur ve do\u011Frudan cihaz\u0131na kaydedilir. Hi\xE7bir \u015Fey y\xFCklenmez.",
        "Reset all data?": "T\xFCm veriler s\u0131f\u0131rlans\u0131n m\u0131?",
        "This cannot be undone.": "Bu geri al\u0131namaz.",
        "Your ledger, completed missions, custom dreams and Two Futures statements will be removed from this device.": "Defterin, tamamlanan g\xF6revlerin, \xF6zel hayallerin ve \u0130ki Gelecek ifadelerin bu cihazdan silinecek.",
        "Reset everything": "Her \u015Feyi s\u0131f\u0131rla",
