        "Skill for life": "\xD6m\xFCr boyu beceri",
        "Finish the degree or certificate you started": "Yar\u0131m b\u0131rakt\u0131\u011F\u0131n diplomay\u0131 ya da sertifikay\u0131 bitir",
        "Close an open chapter: the remaining courses, one exam at a time, until the day you hold it.": "A\xE7\u0131k kalm\u0131\u015F bir b\xF6l\xFCm\xFC kapat: kalan dersleri tek tek ge\xE7erek, elinde tutaca\u011F\u0131n g\xFCne kadar.",
        "Finishing what you started changes how you see every other goal.": "Ba\u015Flad\u0131\u011F\u0131n \u015Feyi bitirmek, di\u011Fer t\xFCm hedeflere bak\u0131\u015F\u0131n\u0131 de\u011Fi\u015Ftirir.",
        "Write down exactly what is left and email the office about the next term.": "Geriye ne kald\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 tam olarak yaz ve bir sonraki d\xF6nem i\xE7in okula e-posta at.",
        "One exam at a time": "Tek tek s\u0131navlar",
        "Close the chapter": "B\xF6l\xFCm\xFC kapat",
        "Recognised qualification": "Tan\u0131nan bir yeterlilik",
        "Write the first draft of your book": "Kitab\u0131n\u0131n ilk tasla\u011F\u0131n\u0131 yaz",
        "Five hundred words a day for a hundred days is a complete first draft.": "G\xFCnde be\u015F y\xFCz kelime, y\xFCz g\xFCn boyunca; i\u015Fte tam bir ilk taslak.",
        "The story in your head deserves to exist outside it.": "Kafanda ta\u015F\u0131d\u0131\u011F\u0131n hik\xE2ye, d\u0131\u015Far\u0131da da var olmay\u0131 hak ediyor.",
