        "Feeding people well is a quiet kind of freedom.": "\u0130nsanlar\u0131 g\xFCzelce doyurmak, sessiz bir \xF6zg\xFCrl\xFCk t\xFCr\xFC.",
        "Choose the first dish and cook it this weekend.": "\u0130lk yeme\u011Fi se\xE7 ve bu hafta sonu pi\u015Fir.",
