        "Host with ease": "Rahat bir ev sahipli\u011Fi",
        "Make your own set of bowls": "Kendi k\xE2se setini yap",
        "A term at a ceramics studio, ending with four bowls you threw, trimmed and glazed yourself.": "Bir seramik at\xF6lyesinde bir d\xF6nem; sonunda kendi elinle \u015Fekillendirip s\u0131rlad\u0131\u011F\u0131n d\xF6rt k\xE2se.",
        "Hands busy, mind quiet, and something real at the end.": "Eller me\u015Fgul, zihin sakin, sonunda elinde ger\xE7ek bir \u015Fey.",
        "Find a studio near you and book a taster class.": "Yak\u0131n\u0131ndaki bir at\xF6lyeyi bul ve deneme dersi ay\u0131rt.",
        "Hands-on": "Elle \xFCretim",
        "Calm focus": "Sakin odaklanma",
        "Four bowls": "D\xF6rt k\xE2se",
        "Run your first half marathon": "\u0130lk yar\u0131 maratonunu ko\u015F",
        "A 16-week plan from easy runs to race day, with good shoes and one registration.": "Kolay ko\u015Fulardan yar\u0131\u015F g\xFCn\xFCne uzanan 16 haftal\u0131k bir plan, iyi ayakkab\u0131lar ve bir kay\u0131t.",
        "Crossing that line rewrites what you believe your body can do.": "O \xE7izgiyi ge\xE7mek, bedeninin neler yapabilece\u011Fine dair inanc\u0131n\u0131 yeniden yazar.",
