        "16-week plan": "16 haftal\u0131k plan",
        "21.1 km": "21,1 km",
        "Race day": "Yar\u0131\u015F g\xFCn\xFC",
        "Get strong: six months with a coach": "G\xFC\xE7len: bir ko\xE7la alt\u0131 ay",
        "Twice-weekly strength sessions with a coach who teaches safe technique and steady progress.": "G\xFCvenli tekni\u011Fi ve d\xFCzenli ilerlemeyi \xF6\u011Freten bir ko\xE7la haftada iki kuvvet antrenman\u0131.",
        "Strength makes every other part of life feel lighter.": "G\xFC\xE7, hayat\u0131n her yan\u0131n\u0131 daha hafif hissettirir.",
        "Do ten bodyweight squats now and book an intro session.": "\u015Eimdi on v\xFCcut a\u011F\u0131rl\u0131\u011F\u0131 squat yap ve bir tan\u0131\u015Fma seans\u0131 ay\u0131rt.",
        "Twice a week": "Haftada iki kez",
        "Safe technique": "G\xFCvenli teknik",
        "Visible progress": "G\xF6zle g\xF6r\xFCl\xFCr ilerleme",
        "A quiet week of yoga and rest": "Sakin bir yoga ve dinlenme haftas\u0131",
        "Seven days of morning movement, simple food, long walks and no notifications.": "Sabah hareketi, sade yemekler, uzun y\xFCr\xFCy\xFC\u015Fler ve bildirimsiz yedi g\xFCn.",
        "Rest is not a reward; it is what makes the next season possible.": "Dinlenmek bir \xF6d\xFCl de\u011Fil; bir sonraki d\xF6nemi m\xFCmk\xFCn k\u0131lan \u015Fey.",
        "Block the week in your calendar before choosing the place.": "Yeri se\xE7meden \xF6nce o haftay\u0131 takvimine i\u015Faretle.",
        "Seven days": "Yedi g\xFCn",
        "Morning practice": "Sabah prati\u011Fi",
        "Phone off": "Telefon kapal\u0131",
        "Hike to a summit you can see from far away": "Uzaktan g\xF6rd\xFC\u011F\xFCn bir zirveye t\u0131rman",
        "Train with weekend hikes, then climb the mountain you have looked at for years.": "Hafta sonu y\xFCr\xFCy\xFC\u015Fleriyle antrenman yap, sonra y\u0131llard\u0131r bakt\u0131\u011F\u0131n o da\u011Fa t\u0131rman.",
        "Some views you only get by walking there.": "Baz\u0131 manzaralar\u0131 ancak oraya y\xFCr\xFCyerek g\xF6rebilirsin.",
