        "Turning an old fear into calm, steady strokes.": "Eski bir korkuyu sakin, kararl\u0131 kula\xE7lara d\xF6n\xFC\u015Ft\xFCrmek.",
        "Call the local pool and ask about adult lessons.": "Yerel havuzu ara ve yeti\u015Fkin dersleri hakk\u0131nda bilgi al.",
        "Adult lessons": "Yeti\u015Fkin dersleri",
        "Open water": "A\xE7\u0131k su",
        "One kilometre": "Bir kilometre",
        "Eat well without thinking about it": "D\xFC\u015F\xFCnmeden iyi beslen",
        "A full health check-up, a few sessions with a dietitian and five go-to meals that make you feel good.": "Kapsaml\u0131 bir sa\u011Fl\u0131k kontrol\xFC, bir diyetisyenle birka\xE7 seans ve seni iyi hissettiren be\u015F favori yemek.",
