        "Dietitian": "Diyetisyen",
        "Five go-to meals": "Be\u015F favori yemek",
        "Grow your own vegetables": "Kendi sebzeni yeti\u015Ftir",
        "A raised bed or balcony boxes, seeds and one full season from planting to harvest.": "Y\xFCkseltilmi\u015F bir yatak ya da balkon kutular\u0131, tohumlar ve ekimden hasada tam bir sezon.",
        "Patience you can eat.": "Yiyebilece\u011Fin bir sab\u0131r.",
        "Buy one pot, soil and a packet of herbs this week.": "Bu hafta bir saks\u0131, toprak ve bir paket tohum al.",
        "One season": "Bir sezon",
        "Balcony or garden": "Balkon ya da bah\xE7e",
        "Harvest": "Hasat",
        "Take your parents on the trip they always mention": "Ailenle her zaman bahsettikleri geziye \xE7\u0131k",
        "The place they talk about, planned around their pace, with time for long meals and slow walks.": "S\xFCrekli konu\u015Ftuklar\u0131 o yer; onlar\u0131n h\u0131z\u0131nda planlanm\u0131\u015F, uzun yemeklere ve a\u011F\u0131r y\xFCr\xFCy\xFC\u015Flere zaman ayr\u0131lm\u0131\u015F.",
        "Time with them is the one thing you cannot buy later.": "Onlarla ge\xE7irdi\u011Fin zaman, sonradan sat\u0131n alamayaca\u011F\u0131n tek \u015Fey.",
        "Call them this week and ask where they would go.": "Bu hafta onlar\u0131 ara ve nereye gitmek istediklerini sor.",
        "Their pace": "Onlar\u0131n h\u0131z\u0131nda",
        "Long meals": "Uzun yemekler",
        "Memories together": "Birlikte an\u0131lar",
        "A monthly family dinner that everyone keeps": "Herkesin s\xFCrd\xFCrd\xFC\u011F\xFC ayl\u0131k bir aile yeme\u011Fi",
        "One evening each month, one long table, phones in a basket, everyone invited.": "Her ay bir ak\u015Fam, uzun bir masa, telefonlar bir sepette, herkes davetli.",
