        "year": "y\u0131l",
        "month": "ay",
        "Payment is charged to your Apple ID. The subscription renews automatically unless cancelled at least 24 hours before the end of the period; manage or cancel it any time in your Apple ID settings.": "\xD6deme Apple Kimli\u011Fi hesab\u0131ndan al\u0131n\u0131r. Abonelik, d\xF6nem bitmeden en az 24 saat \xF6nce iptal edilmezse otomatik olarak yenilenir; Apple Kimli\u011Fi ayarlar\u0131ndan istedi\u011Fin an y\xF6netebilir ya da iptal edebilirsin.",
        "The rest of this course is part of ODA Pro.": "Bu kursun devam\u0131 ODA Pro'da.",
        "The first two lessons of every course are free, and so is the whole Turning Point Day.": "Her kursun ilk iki dersi \xFCcretsiz; D\xF6n\xFCm Noktas\u0131 G\xFCn\xFC'n\xFCn tamam\u0131 da \xF6yle.",
        "See ODA Pro": "ODA Pro'yu g\xF6r",
        "That code didn\u2019t work. Check it or send a new email.": "Bu kod \xE7al\u0131\u015Fmad\u0131. Kontrol et ya da yeni bir e-posta g\xF6nder.",
        "Enter the code from the email.": "E-postadaki kodu gir.",
        "We sent a sign-in code to {email}. Enter it below.": "{email} adresine bir giri\u015F kodu g\xF6nderdik. A\u015Fa\u011F\u0131ya yaz.",
        "Code from the email": "E-postadaki kod",
        "Checking\u2026": "Kontrol ediliyor\u2026",
        "this week": "bu hafta",
        "Did it? Tap the check \xB7 +D$ {amount}": "Yapt\u0131n m\u0131? Onay i\u015Faretine dokun \xB7 +D$ {amount}",
        "Write it in a few words\u2026": "Birka\xE7 kelimeyle yaz\u2026",
        "Quick actions": "H\u0131zl\u0131 i\u015Flemler",
        "Plan for obstacles": "Engellere plan",
        "30 seconds": "30 saniye",
        "A promise said out loud holds": "S\xF6ylenen s\xF6z daha sa\u011Flam",
        "Think it through": "Birlikte d\xFC\u015F\xFCnelim",
        "With the coach": "Ko\xE7la",
        "Calm, focus, sleep": "Sakinlik, odak, uyku",
        "Guided courses": "Rehberli kurslar",
        "A short lesson": "K\u0131sa bir ders",
        "An example": "Bir \xF6rnek",
        "Some courses are not yet available in your language; they open in the language they were written in.": "Baz\u0131 kurslar hen\xFCz T\xFCrk\xE7e de\u011Fil; yaz\u0131ld\u0131klar\u0131 dilde a\xE7\u0131l\u0131r.",
        "Drained": "Bitkin",
        "Low": "D\xFC\u015F\xFCk",
        "Steady": "Dengeli",
        "Good": "\u0130yi",
        "Bright": "Parlak",
        "Heavy": "A\u011F\u0131r",
        "Uneasy": "Huzursuz",
        "Even": "Dingin",
        "Lifted": "Y\xFCkselmi\u015F",
        "Arriving": "Bug\xFCne var\u0131\u015F",
        "Edit how you are arriving": "Nas\u0131l geldi\u011Fini d\xFCzenle",
        "How are you arriving?": "Bug\xFCne nas\u0131l geliyorsun?",
        "Tap your energy. It takes one second.": "Enerjine dokun. Bir saniye s\xFCrer.",
        "Low energy is a fine place to start. Make today\u2019s decision the 2-minute version.": "D\xFC\u015F\xFCk enerji ba\u015Flamak i\xE7in uygun bir yer. Bug\xFCn\xFCn karar\u0131n\u0131 2 dakikal\u0131k haline getir.",
        "On a low day, choose something very small. It still counts.": "D\xFC\u015F\xFCk bir g\xFCnde \xE7ok k\xFC\xE7\xFCk bir \u015Fey se\xE7. Yine de say\u0131l\u0131r.",
        "Today\u2019s decision is kept. Rest counts too. A few quiet minutes might help.": "Bug\xFCn\xFCn karar\u0131n\u0131 tuttun. Dinlenmek de say\u0131l\u0131r. Birka\xE7 sakin dakika iyi gelebilir.",
        "Open the Sound Room": "Ses Odas\u0131\u2019n\u0131 a\xE7",
        "Go gently today. Make the decision the 2-minute version, or start with a few quiet minutes.": "Bug\xFCn nazik ol. Karar\u0131 2 dakikal\u0131k haline getir ya da birka\xE7 sakin dakikayla ba\u015Fla.",
        "A steady day. Do today\u2019s decision first, and let the rest follow.": "Dengeli bir g\xFCn. \xD6nce bug\xFCn\xFCn karar\u0131n\u0131 yap, gerisi kendili\u011Finden gelir.",
        "A steady day is a good day to keep things simple.": "Dengeli bir g\xFCn, i\u015Fleri sade tutmak i\xE7in iyi bir g\xFCn.",
        "You have some energy today. A short lesson is a good way to use it.": "Bug\xFCn biraz enerjin var. K\u0131sa bir ders onu de\u011Ferlendirmenin g\xFCzel bir yolu.",
        "Open: {title}": "A\xE7: {title}",
        "Open a lesson": "Bir ders a\xE7",
        "And your mood? Optional.": "Peki ruh halin? \u0130ste\u011Fe ba\u011Fl\u0131.",
        "One line about today": "Bug\xFCn hakk\u0131nda tek sat\u0131r",
        "Whatever stayed with you. It goes into your notebook.": "Akl\u0131nda kalan her \u015Fey. Defterine eklenir.",
        "Today I\u2026": "Bug\xFCn ben\u2026",
        "Added to today\u2019s page in your notebook.": "Defterindeki bug\xFCn\xFCn sayfas\u0131na eklendi.",
        "Today\u2019s prompt": "Bug\xFCn\xFCn sorusu",
        "Use this prompt": "Bu soruyu kullan",
        "{month}: written on {n} of {total} days so far. Days: {days}.": "{month}: \u015Fimdiye kadar {total} g\xFCn\xFCn {n} g\xFCn\xFCnde yaz\u0131ld\u0131. G\xFCnler: {days}.",
        "{month}: no writing yet this month.": "{month}: bu ay hen\xFCz yaz\u0131 yok.",
        "What is one small thing that went better than I expected this week?": "Bu hafta bekledi\u011Fimden daha iyi giden k\xFC\xE7\xFCk bir \u015Fey ne oldu?",
        "Which promise to myself am I quietly proud of keeping?": "Kendime verdi\u011Fim hangi s\xF6z\xFC tuttu\u011Fum i\xE7in sessizce gurur duyuyorum?",
        "What would I do today if I trusted myself a little more?": "Kendime biraz daha g\xFCvenseydim bug\xFCn ne yapard\u0131m?",
        "Who has made my life easier lately, and what would I like them to know?": "Son zamanlarda hayat\u0131m\u0131 kim kolayla\u015Ft\u0131rd\u0131 ve ona neyi bilmesini isterdim?",
        "What am I carrying that I could set down for one evening?": "Ta\u015F\u0131d\u0131\u011F\u0131m hangi y\xFCk\xFC bir ak\u015Faml\u0131\u011F\u0131na b\u0131rakabilirim?",
        "Describe a moment today when I felt most like myself.": "Bug\xFCn kendim gibi hissetti\u011Fim en belirgin an\u0131 anlat.",
        "What is the kindest thing I could say to myself right now?": "\u015Eu an kendime s\xF6yleyebilece\u011Fim en nazik s\xF6z ne olurdu?",
        "What did I avoid this week, and what is the smallest first step toward it?": "Bu hafta neyden ka\xE7\u0131nd\u0131m ve ona do\u011Fru at\u0131lacak en k\xFC\xE7\xFCk ilk ad\u0131m ne?",
        "Which ordinary part of my day would I miss if it were gone?": "G\xFCn\xFCm\xFCn hangi s\u0131radan par\xE7as\u0131 olmasa \xF6zlerdim?",
        "What do I want more of in my days, and what could I do about it today?": "G\xFCnlerimde nelerin daha fazlas\u0131n\u0131 istiyorum ve bug\xFCn bunun i\xE7in ne yapabilirim?",
        "When did I last feel calm, and what was around me?": "En son ne zaman sakin hissettim ve etraf\u0131mda ne vard\u0131?",
        "What is a decision I made recently that I would make again?": "Yak\u0131n zamanda verdi\u011Fim ve yine verirdim diyece\u011Fim bir karar ne?",
        "What am I learning about myself that I did not know a year ago?": "Bir y\u0131l \xF6nce bilmedi\u011Fim, kendim hakk\u0131nda neyi \xF6\u011Freniyorum?",
        "Write about a place where I feel safe, and what makes it so.": "Kendimi g\xFCvende hissetti\u011Fim bir yeri ve onu b\xF6yle yapan \u015Feyi yaz.",
        "What would a good day look like, in detail, from waking to sleep?": "\u0130yi bir g\xFCn, uyanmaktan uyumaya kadar ayr\u0131nt\u0131lar\u0131yla nas\u0131l g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCrd\xFC?",
        "Which worry is loudest today, and what is actually within my control?": "Bug\xFCn en y\xFCksek sesle konu\u015Fan endi\u015Fe hangisi ve ger\xE7ekte neler benim elimde?",
        "What is one thing I can forgive myself for?": "Kendimi affedebilece\u011Fim bir \u015Fey ne?",
        "Who do I want to become a little more like, and what do they do differently?": "Kime biraz daha benzemek istiyorum ve o farkl\u0131 olarak ne yap\u0131yor?",
        "What made me smile today, however briefly?": "Bug\xFCn, ne kadar k\u0131sa da olsa, beni ne g\xFCl\xFCmsetti?",
        "What does rest look like for me, and when did I last allow it?": "Benim i\xE7in dinlenmek neye benziyor ve en son ne zaman buna izin verdim?",
        "What would I tell a close friend who was in my exact situation?": "Tam benim durumumda olan yak\u0131n bir arkada\u015F\u0131ma ne s\xF6ylerdim?",
        "What is a small courage I showed recently that no one noticed?": "Yak\u0131n zamanda g\xF6sterdi\u011Fim ve kimsenin fark etmedi\u011Fi k\xFC\xE7\xFCk bir cesaret ne?",
        "What do I want to remember about this season of my life?": "Hayat\u0131m\u0131n bu d\xF6neminden neyi hat\u0131rlamak istiyorum?",
        "If tomorrow could start one small thing well, what would it be?": "Yar\u0131n k\xFC\xE7\xFCk bir \u015Feyi iyi ba\u015Flatabilseydi, bu ne olurdu?",
        "Lighter": "Daha hafif",
        "Your month": "Senin ay\u0131n",
        "Last 5 weeks: {kept} days with a kept decision, {written} days of writing.": "Son 5 hafta: {kept} g\xFCn tutulan karar, {written} g\xFCn yaz\u0131.",
        "Kept decision": "Tutulan karar",
        "Wrote in journal": "G\xFCnl\xFC\u011Fe yazd\u0131m",
        "Both": "\u0130kisi de",
        "Quiet day": "Sakin g\xFCn",
        "Insight": "Fark etti\u011Fim \u015Fey",
        "Keep 5 decisions and a pattern about your best day or time will appear here. {n} so far.": "5 karar tut, en iyi g\xFCn\xFCn ya da saatinle ilgili bir \xF6r\xFCnt\xFC burada g\xF6r\xFCns\xFCn. \u015Eimdilik {n}.",
        "{day} is your strongest day: {n} of your {total} kept decisions.": "En g\xFC\xE7l\xFC g\xFCn\xFCn {day}: tuttu\u011Fun {total} karar\u0131n {n} tanesi o g\xFCn.",
        "You keep most of your decisions in the morning: {n} of {total}.": "Kararlar\u0131n\u0131n \xE7o\u011Funu sabah tutuyorsun: {total} karar\u0131n {n} tanesi.",
        "You keep most of your decisions in the afternoon: {n} of {total}.": "Kararlar\u0131n\u0131n \xE7o\u011Funu \xF6\u011Fleden sonra tutuyorsun: {total} karar\u0131n {n} tanesi.",
        "You keep most of your decisions in the evening: {n} of {total}.": "Kararlar\u0131n\u0131n \xE7o\u011Funu ak\u015Fam tutuyorsun: {total} karar\u0131n {n} tanesi.",
        "You keep your word across the whole week, at all hours. No single pattern stands out.": "S\xF6z\xFCn\xFC haftan\u0131n her g\xFCn\xFC, her saatte tutuyorsun. \xD6ne \xE7\u0131kan tek bir \xF6r\xFCnt\xFC yok.",
        "Milestones": "Kilometre ta\u015Flar\u0131",
        "{n} of {total}": "{n} / {total}",
        "First kept decision": "\u0130lk tutulan karar",
        "Keep one decision today.": "Bug\xFCn bir karar tut.",
        "7 kept decisions": "7 tutulan karar",
        "Keep seven in total.": "Toplamda yedi karar tut.",
        "30 kept decisions": "30 tutulan karar",
        "Keep thirty in total.": "Toplamda otuz karar tut.",
        "3-day chain": "3 g\xFCnl\xFCk zincir",
        "Keep a decision three days in a row.": "\xDC\xE7 g\xFCn \xFCst \xFCste bir karar tut.",
        "First journal entry": "\u0130lk g\xFCnl\xFCk yaz\u0131s\u0131",
        "Write a few lines in your notebook.": "Defterine birka\xE7 sat\u0131r yaz.",
        "10 days written": "10 g\xFCn yaz\u0131",
        "Write on ten different days.": "On farkl\u0131 g\xFCnde yaz.",
        "First lesson done": "\u0130lk ders tamam",
        "Finish a course lesson.": "Bir kurs dersini bitir.",
        "First dream bought": "\u0130lk hayal al\u0131nd\u0131",
        "Spend Dream Dollars on a dream.": "Dream Dollar'\u0131 bir hayale harca.",
        "Your vision board": "Vizyon panon",
        "Add a dream from Explore and it will appear here as a picture. Seeing what you are working toward makes it easier to keep going.": "Ke\u015Ffet'ten bir hayal ekle, burada resim olarak g\xF6r\xFCns\xFCn. Neye do\u011Fru \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 g\xF6rmek devam etmeyi kolayla\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131r.",
        "Explore dreams": "Hayalleri ke\u015Ffet",
        "All done": "Tamamland\u0131",
        "Step {n} of {total}": "Ad\u0131m {n} / {total}",
        "Close exercise": "Al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131rmay\u0131 kapat",
        "Box breathing": "Kutu nefesi",
        "Breathe in for 4, hold for 4, breathe out for 4, hold for 4. Four rounds take about a minute.": "4 saniye nefes al, 4 saniye tut, 4 saniye ver, 4 saniye bekle. D\xF6rt tur yakla\u015F\u0131k bir dakika s\xFCrer.",
        "Sit comfortably and let your shoulders drop. If holding your breath feels uncomfortable, simply pause for a moment instead, or stop whenever you like.": "Rahat otur ve omuzlar\u0131n\u0131 b\u0131rak. Nefesini tutmak rahats\u0131z edici gelirse k\u0131sa bir duraklama yap ya da istedi\u011Fin an dur.",
        "A square outline that guides your breathing": "Nefesine rehberlik eden bir kare \xE7er\xE7eve",
        "Round {n} of {total}": "Tur {n} / {total}",
        "That was a minute for your body. Notice whether anything feels a little quieter, even if only slightly.": "Bu, bedenin i\xE7in bir dakikayd\u0131. Bir \u015Feyin biraz daha sakinle\u015Fip sakinle\u015Fmedi\u011Fine, k\xFC\xE7\xFCc\xFCk de olsa, bak.",
        "Again": "Tekrar",
        "Five things you can see": "G\xF6rebildi\u011Fin be\u015F \u015Fey",
        "Look slowly around the room. Name each one, out loud or in your head.": "Odaya yava\u015F\xE7a bak. Her birini sesli ya da i\xE7inden adland\u0131r.",
        "Four things you can touch": "Dokunabildi\u011Fin d\xF6rt \u015Fey",
        "Feel your feet on the floor, the fabric of your clothes, the surface under your hands.": "Ayaklar\u0131n\u0131n yerdeki temas\u0131n\u0131, k\u0131yafetlerinin kuma\u015F\u0131n\u0131, ellerinin alt\u0131ndaki y\xFCzeyi hisset.",
        "Three things you can hear": "Duyabildi\u011Fin \xFC\xE7 ses",
        "Near sounds and far sounds. Include the quiet ones.": "Yak\u0131n sesler ve uzak sesler. Sessiz olanlar\u0131 da say.",
        "Two things you can smell": "Koklayabildi\u011Fin iki \u015Fey",
        "If nothing stands out, remember a smell you like.": "Belirgin bir \u015Fey yoksa sevdi\u011Fin bir kokuyu hat\u0131rla.",
        "One thing you can taste": "Tadabildi\u011Fin bir \u015Fey",
        "A sip of water works, or simply notice the taste in your mouth.": "Bir yudum su iyi gelir; ya da a\u011Fz\u0131ndaki tad\u0131 fark etmen yeter.",
        "5-4-3-2-1 grounding": "5-4-3-2-1 topraklanma",
        "Finish": "Bitir",
        "You have named what is here, right now. Take one slow breath and see how you feel compared to a few minutes ago.": "\u015Eu anda burada olan\u0131 adland\u0131rd\u0131n. Yava\u015F bir nefes al ve birka\xE7 dakika \xF6ncesine g\xF6re nas\u0131l hissetti\u011Fine bak.",
        "This is now your one decision for today.": "Bu art\u0131k bug\xFCn\xFCn tek karar\u0131n.",
        "You already have a decision for today, so this stays as a note.": "Bug\xFCn i\xE7in zaten bir karar\u0131n var, bu y\xFCzden bu bir not olarak kal\u0131yor.",
        "Make it today's decision": "Bug\xFCn\xFCn karar\u0131 yap",
        "Situation": "Durum",
        "Only the facts, as a camera would record them.": "Yaln\u0131zca olgular, bir kameran\u0131n kaydedece\u011Fi gibi.",
        "Example: My manager asked to talk tomorrow.": "\xD6rnek: Y\xF6neticim yar\u0131n konu\u015Fmak istedi.",
        "The thought": "D\xFC\u015F\xFCnce",
        "What is the thought?": "D\xFC\u015F\xFCnce nedir?",
        "The exact words your mind is telling you.": "Zihninin sana s\xF6yledi\u011Fi tam s\xF6zler.",
        "Example: I am about to be let go.": "\xD6rnek: \u0130\u015Ften \xE7\u0131kar\u0131laca\u011F\u0131m.",
        "Evidence for": "Destekleyen kan\u0131tlar",
        "What supports this thought?": "Bu d\xFC\u015F\xFCnceyi ne destekliyor?",
        "Facts only. A strong feeling is real, but it is not proof.": "Yaln\u0131zca olgular. G\xFC\xE7l\xFC bir duygu ger\xE7ektir ama kan\u0131t de\u011Fildir.",
        "Example: The meeting was scheduled without a reason.": "\xD6rnek: Toplant\u0131 nedeni s\xF6ylenmeden ayarland\u0131.",
        "Evidence against": "\xC7eli\u015Fen kan\u0131tlar",
        "What does not fit this thought?": "Bu d\xFC\u015F\xFCnceye neler uymuyor?",
        "Other explanations, times it went differently, what a friend would point out.": "Ba\u015Fka a\xE7\u0131klamalar, i\u015Flerin farkl\u0131 gitti\u011Fi zamanlar, bir arkada\u015F\u0131n\u0131n dikkat \xE7ekece\u011Fi \u015Feyler.",
        "Example: My last review was good, and they often meet people one to one.": "\xD6rnek: Son de\u011Ferlendirmem iyiydi ve insanlarla s\u0131k s\u0131k birebir g\xF6r\xFC\u015F\xFCyorlar.",
        "A more balanced thought": "Daha dengeli bir d\xFC\u015F\xFCnce",
        "Write a kinder, more balanced thought": "Daha nazik, daha dengeli bir d\xFC\u015F\xFCnce yaz",
        "Say it as you would to a friend. It should be believable, not forced positivity.": "Bir arkada\u015F\u0131na s\xF6yler gibi s\xF6yle. \u0130nand\u0131r\u0131c\u0131 olmal\u0131, zorlama olumluluk de\u011Fil.",
        "Example: I do not know yet. I can prepare and listen.": "\xD6rnek: Hen\xFCz bilmiyorum. Haz\u0131rlanabilir ve dinleyebilirim.",
        "Next small step": "S\u0131radaki k\xFC\xE7\xFCk ad\u0131m",
        "Choose one small next step": "S\u0131radaki k\xFC\xE7\xFCk bir ad\u0131m se\xE7",
        "Small enough that you could start within a day.": "Bir g\xFCn i\xE7inde ba\u015Flayabilece\u011Fin kadar k\xFC\xE7\xFCk.",
        "Example: Write down two questions to ask tomorrow.": "\xD6rnek: Yar\u0131n soraca\u011F\u0131m iki soruyu yazmak.",
        "Reframe a thought": "Bir d\xFC\u015F\xFCnceyi yeniden \xE7er\xE7evele",
        "See my reframe": "Yeniden \xE7er\xE7evelemi g\xF6r",
        "Save to notebook": "Deftere kaydet",
        "it is {when}": "{when} oldu\u011Funda",
        "If it is {when}, then I will {action}": "{when} oldu\u011Funda, \u015Funu yapaca\u011F\u0131m: {action}",
        "Unstick in 2 minutes": "2 dakikada harekete ge\xE7",
        "What are you putting off?": "Neyi erteliyorsun?",
        "Name it in a few words. It does not need to be neat.": "Birka\xE7 kelimeyle adland\u0131r. D\xFCzg\xFCn olmas\u0131 gerekmiyor.",
        "Example: Send the invoice": "\xD6rnek: Faturay\u0131 g\xF6ndermek",
        "Shrink it to the first 2 minutes": "\u0130lk 2 dakikaya indir",
