  var drafts2 = [
    q2(
      "adaptation",
      "2:37",
      "Bakara",
      "\xC2dem\u2019in hik\xE2yesinde hata, d\xF6n\xFC\u015F\xFCn sonu olmad\u0131; Rabbinden \xF6\u011Frendi\u011Fi s\xF6zlerle yeniden y\xF6neldi. Kendini yaln\u0131zca yan\u0131lg\u0131nla tan\u0131mlama; pi\u015Fmanl\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 bug\xFCn d\xFCr\xFCst bir ba\u015Flang\u0131ca d\xF6n\xFC\u015Ft\xFCrebilirsin.",
      "Adam\u2019s mistake did not end his return; he turned back with words received from his Lord. You are more than your error: let remorse become an honest beginning today.",
      ["hope", "repentance", "action"]
    ),
    q2(
      "adaptation",
      "2:155-157",
      "Bakara",
      "Kur\u2019an korkuyu ve kayb\u0131 insan\u0131n imtihanlar\u0131 aras\u0131nda anar. Sars\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131nda kendini inan\xE7s\u0131z sayma; ac\u0131n\u0131 kabul ederek Allah\u2019a y\xF6nelmek, sabr\u0131n i\xE7inden at\u0131lan ger\xE7ek bir ad\u0131md\u0131r.",
      "The Quran names fear and loss among human trials. Being shaken does not make you faithless; acknowledging pain while turning to God is a real step within patience.",
      ["fear", "patience", "hope"]
    ),
    q2(
      "adaptation",
      "2:214",
      "Bakara",
      "\xD6ncekiler de \xF6ylesine sars\u0131ld\u0131 ki yard\u0131m\u0131n ne zaman gelece\u011Fini sordular. Zorlanman yolunun de\u011Fersiz oldu\u011Funu g\xF6stermez; bu sorunun i\xE7inde bile dayan\u0131\u015Fmaya ve duaya yer a\xE7abilirsin.",
      "Those before you were shaken enough to ask when help would come. Struggle does not empty your path of meaning; even that question can make room for prayer and solidarity.",
      ["fear", "uncertainty", "hope"]
