      "4:114",
      "Nis\xE2",
      "Onlar\u0131n gizli konu\u015Fmalar\u0131n\u0131n \xE7o\u011Funda hay\u0131r yoktur; sadakay\u0131, iyi olan\u0131 veya insanlar\u0131n aras\u0131n\u0131 d\xFCzeltmeyi \xF6\u011F\xFCtleyenler ba\u015Fkad\u0131r. Bunu Allah\u2019\u0131n ho\u015Fnutlu\u011Funu arayarak yapana b\xFCy\xFCk bir \xF6d\xFCl verece\u011Fiz.",
      "Little good lies in much of their private talk, except words urging charity, what is right, or reconciliation between people. Whoever does this seeking God\u2019s pleasure will receive a great reward.",
