      "M\xE2ide",
      "De ki: K\xF6t\xFC ile temiz olan bir de\u011Fildir; k\xF6t\xFCn\xFCn \xE7oklu\u011Fu seni hayran b\u0131raksa bile. \xD6yleyse ey ak\u0131l sahipleri, Allah\u2019a kar\u015F\u0131 sorumlulu\u011Funuzu g\xF6zetin ki kurtulu\u015Fa eresiniz.",
      "Say: What is corrupt and what is wholesome are not equal, even when the abundance of corruption impresses you. People of understanding, remain mindful of God, so that you may flourish.",
