    q2(
      "translation",
      "6:59",
      "En\u2018\xE2m",
      "G\xF6r\xFCnmeyenin anahtarlar\u0131 O\u2019nun yan\u0131ndad\u0131r; onlar\u0131 O\u2019ndan ba\u015Fkas\u0131 bilmez. Karada ve denizde ne varsa bilir. Bir tek yaprak bile O\u2019nun bilgisi d\u0131\u015F\u0131nda yere d\xFC\u015Fmez.",
      "The keys of the unseen are with Him alone. He knows what lies on land and in the sea; not even a single falling leaf escapes His knowledge.",
