      "6:160",
      "En\u2018\xE2m",
      "Kim bir iyilikle gelirse, ona yapt\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131n on kat\u0131 vard\u0131r. Kim bir k\xF6t\xFCl\xFCkle gelirse, yaln\u0131zca onun dengiyle kar\u015F\u0131l\u0131k g\xF6r\xFCr; onlara hi\xE7bir \u015Fekilde haks\u0131zl\u0131k edilmez.",
      "Whoever brings a good deed receives ten times its like; whoever brings an evil deed receives only its equivalent. No injustice will be done to them.",
      ["goodness", "justice", "hope"]
